ts Effect IO para JVM","fr":"Guide de mise en route de Cats Effect IO pour JVM","de":"Einrichtungsleitfaden für Cats Effect IO auf der JVM","pt":"Guia de Configuração do Cats Effect IO para JVM","ru":"Настройка Cats Effect IO: ИИ Агенты для JVM","ar":"دليل إعداد Cats Effect IO للجافا"},"description":{"en":"Unlock efficient database management with cats-effect-io. Learn how to treat side effects as effect values and wrap Java blocking calls for seamless integrat...","zh":"了解 Cats Effect IO 的优势，包括结构化并发和资源管理，用于 JVM 的数据库工具包","ja":"Cats Effect IO の特徴とベネフィットを紹介します。Java エージェントのための並行性ツール","ko":"Cats Effect IO에 대한 정보를 제공합니다. JVM용 데이터베이스 툴킷의 구조화된 并发과 리소스 관리","es":"Aprende a dominar Cats Effect IO, una herramienta de base de datos para JVM, con nuestra guía de mejores prácticas y tutoriales","fr":"Maîtrisez Cats Effect IO, un outil de base de données pour JVM, avec notre guide de bonnes pratiques et didacticiels","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie Cats Effect IO, ein Datenbank-Toolkit für die JVM, mit unserem Leitfaden für Best Practices und Tutorials meistern","pt":"Aprenda a usar o Cats Effect IO, uma ferramenta de banco de dados para JVM, com dicas de configuração e boas práticas","ru":"ИИ Агенты для JVM: узнайте, как настроить Cats Effect IO и использовать его возможности","ar":"تعرف على Cats Effect IO وأفضل الطرق لاستخدامه في تطوير الجافا"},"definition":{"en":"cats-effect-io is a JVM database toolkit that provides a structured approach to handling side effects and resources using IO, SyncIO, and Resource.","zh":"Cats Effect IO 是一个用于 JVM 的数据库工具包","ja":"Cats Effect IO は Java 用の並行性ツールです","ko":"Cats Effect IO는 JVM용 데이터베이스 툴킷입니다","es":"Cats Effect IO es un toolkit de base de datos para JVM que maneja efectos laterales como valores de efecto","fr":"Cats Effect IO est un kit d''outils de base de données pour JVM qui gère les effets secondaires comme des valeurs d''effet","de":"Cats Effect IO ist ein Datenbank-Toolkit für die JVM, das Nebeneffekte als Effektwerte handhabt","pt":"O que é Cats Effect IO? É uma ferramenta de banco de dados para JVM que trata efeitos colaterais como valores de efeito","ru":"Что такое Cats Effect IO? Это инструмент для работы с базами данных на JVM, который обрабатывает побочные эффекты как значения эффектов","ar":"ما هو Cats Effect IO? هو أداة قواعد البيانات للجافا التي تعامل مع الآثار الجانبية كقيم تأثير"},"features":{"en":["Treats every side effect as an effect value using IO[A], SyncIO[A], or F[A]","Wraps Java blocking calls with IO.blocking or IO.interruptible","Provides Resource for acquiring and releasing resources","Supports structured concurrency using parTraverse, parMapN, and background","Utilizes Supervisor for program entry points and error handling"],"zh":["结构化并发（parTraverse、parMapN、background、Supervisor）","资源管理（Resource）","程序入口点（IOApp）","Java 阻塞调用支持（IO.blocking、IO.interruptible）","Sync 和 Async 支持"],"ja":["構造化された並行性（parTraverse、parMapN、background、Supervisor）","リソース管理（Resource）","プログラム入口点（IOApp）","Java ブロッキング呼び出しサポート（IO.blocking、IO.interruptible）","Sync と Async サポート"],"ko":["구조화된 并发（parTraverse、parMapN、background、Supervisor）","리소스 관리（Resource）","프로그램入口점（IOApp）","Java 블록킹 호출 지원（IO.blocking、IO.interruptible）","Sync와 Async 지원"],"es":["Tratar cada efecto lateral como un valor de efecto con IO[A], SyncIO[A] o F[A]","Uso de IO.blocking e IO.interruptible para llamar a métodos de bloqueo de Java","Adquisición y liberación de recursos con Resource","Puntos de entrada de programa con IOApp","Preferencia de concurrencia estructurada con parTraverse, parMapN, background y Supervisor"],"fr":["Traiter chaque effet secondaire comme une valeur d''effet avec IO[A], SyncIO[A] ou F[A]","Utilisation de IO.blocking et IO.interruptible pour appeler des méthodes de blocage Java","Acquisition et libération de ressources avec Resource","Points d''entrée de programme avec IOApp","Préférence de la concurrence structurée avec parTraverse, parMapN, background et Supervisor"],"de":["Jedes Nebeneffekt als Effektwert mit IO[A], SyncIO[A] oder F[A] behandeln","Verwendung von IO.blocking und IO.interruptible zum Aufruf von Java-Blockierungsmethoden","Erwerb und Freigabe von Ressourcen mit Resource","Programmeinstiegspunkte mit IOApp","Präferenz für strukturierte Konkurrenz mit parTraverse, parMapN, background und Supervisor"],"pt":["Trate efeitos colaterais como valores de efeito com IO[A], SyncIO[A] ou F[A]","Use IO.blocking ou IO.interruptible para chamadas de bloqueio Java","Aquire e libere recursos com Resource","Use IOApp para pontos de entrada de programa","Preferir concorrência estruturada com parTraverse, parMapN, background e Supervisor"],"ru":["Обрабатывайте побочные эффекты как значения эффектов с IO[A], SyncIO[A] или F[A]","Используйте IO.blocking или IO.interruptible для блокирующих вызовов Java","Приобретайте и освобождайте ресурсы с помощью Resource","Используйте IOApp для точек входа программы","Предпочитайте структурированную конкурентность с parTraverse, parMapN, background и Supervisor"],"ar":["تعامل مع الآثار الجانبية كقيم تأثير مع IO[A], SyncIO[A] أو F[A]","استخدم IO.blocking أو IO.interruptible للنداءات الجافا المحظورة","احصل على موارد وإطلاقها باستخدام Resource","استخدم IOApp لنقاط الدخول البرنامج","افضل التزامن المنظم مع parTraverse, parMapN, background و Supervisor"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use cats-effect-io","cats-effect-io vs monix","cats-effect-io setup guide","what is cats-effect-io","cats-effect-io alternative","cats-effect-io install","scala cats-effect-io tutorial","jvm database toolkit","cats-effect-io resource management"],"zh":["Cats Effect IO","JVM 数据库工具包","结构化并发","资源管理","Java 阻塞调用","Sync 和 Async","并行性工具","Java 开发工具"],"ja":["Cats Effect IO","Java エージェント","並行性ツール","構造化された並行性","リソース管理","Java ブロッキング呼び出し","Sync と Async","Java 開発ツール"],"ko":["Cats Effect IO","JVM 데이터베이스 툴킷","구조화된 并发","리소스 관리","Java 블록킹 호출","Sync와 Async","並行性 툴","Java 개발 툴"],"es":["Cats Effect IO","herramienta de base de datos para JVM","efectos laterales","IO[A]","SyncIO[A]","F[A]","concurrencia estructurada","Resource","IOApp"],"fr":["Cats Effect IO","outil de base de données pour JVM","effets secondaires","IO[A]","SyncIO[A]","F[A]","concurrence structurée","Resource","IOApp"],"de":["Cats Effect IO","Datenbank-Toolkit für die JVM","Nebeneffekte","IO[A]","SyncIO[A]","F[A]","strukturierte Konkurrenz","Resource","IOApp"],"pt":["Cats Effect IO","JVM","banco de dados","efeitos colaterais","IO[A]","SyncIO[A]","F[A]","Resource","IOApp","concorrência estruturada"],"ru":["Cats Effect IO","JVM","база данных","побочные эффекты","IO[A]","SyncIO[A]","F[A]","Resource","IOApp","структурированная конкурентность","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["Cats Effect IO","جافا","قواعد البيانات","الآثار الجانبية","IO[A]","SyncIO[A]","F[A]","Resource","IOApp","التزامن المنظم","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"funfix","repo":"database","repoPath":"funfix/database","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.452Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cats-effect-io","description":"Scala functional programming with Cats Effect IO and typeclasses. Use for wrapping side effects, modeling purity, choosing Sync/Async/Temporal/Concurrent, handling blocking I/O, and composing resources, fibers, and concurrency safely.","bodyPreview":"# Cats Effect IO (Scala)\n\n## Quick start\n- Treat every side effect as an effect value: return `IO[A]`, `SyncIO[A]`, or `F[A]` with `F[_]: Sync`/`Async`/`Temporal` as needed.\n- Wrap Java blocking calls with `IO.blocking` or `IO.interruptible` (or `Sync[F].blocking`/`interruptible`).\n- Use `Resource` to acquire/release resources and `IOApp` for program entry points.\n- Prefer structured concurrency (`parTraverse`, `parMapN`, `background`, `Supervisor`) over manual fiber management.\n- Read `referenc","body":"# Cats Effect IO (Scala)\n\n## Quick start\n- Treat every side effect as an effect value: return `IO[A]`, `SyncIO[A]`, or `F[A]` with `F[_]: Sync`/`Async`/`Temporal` as needed.\n- Wrap Java blocking calls with `IO.blocking` or `IO.interruptible` (or `Sync[F].blocking`/`interruptible`).\n- Use `Resource` to acquire/release resources and `IOApp` for program entry points.\n- Prefer structured concurrency (`parTraverse`, `parMapN`, `background`, `Supervisor`) over manual fiber management.\n- Read `references/cats-effect-io.md` for concepts, recipes, and FAQ guidance.\n- For deeper `Resource` guidance, use the `cats-effect-resource` skill (install: `npx skills add https://github.com/alexandru/skills --skill cats-effect-resource`).\n\n## Workflow\n1. Classify side effects and choose the effect type: `IO` directly or polymorphic `F[_]` with the smallest required Cats Effect typeclass (`Sync`, `Async`, `Temporal`, `Concurrent`).\n2. Wrap side-effectful code using `IO(...)`, `IO.blocking`, `IO.interruptible`, or `IO.async` (or their `Sync`/`Async` equivalents).\n3. Manage resources with `Resource` or `bracket` and keep acquisition/release inside effects.\n4. Compose effects with `flatMap`/for-comprehensions and collection combinators (`traverse`, `parTraverse`).\n5. Use concurrency primitives (`Ref`, `Deferred`, `Queue`, `Semaphore`, `Supervisor`) and structured concurrency to avoid fiber leaks.\n\n## Side-effect rules (apply to `IO`, `SyncIO`, and to `F[_]: Sync/Async`)\n- All side-effectful functions must return results wrapped in `IO` (or `F[_]` with Cats Effect typeclasses).\n- Side-effects include all non-determinism (call sites are not referentially transparent):\n  - Any I/O (files, sockets, console, databases).\n  - `Instant.now()`, `Random.nextInt()`.\n  - Any read from shared mutable state (the read itself is the side effect).\n  - Returning mutable data structures (for example, `Array[Int]`).\n\n## Blocking I/O rules\n- Java blocking methods must be wrapped in `IO.blocking` or `IO.interruptible` (or `Sync[F].blocking`/`interruptible`) so they run on the blocking pool.\n- Prefer `IO.interruptible` for methods that may throw `InterruptedException` or `IOException`, but not for resource disposal.\n- Use `IO.blocking` for cleanup/disposal (`Closeable#close`, `AutoCloseable#close`).\n\n## Output expectations\n- Make side effects explicit in signatures (`IO`/`SyncIO` or `F[_]: Sync/Async`); the guidance here applies equally to concrete `IO` and polymorphic `F[_]`.\n- Use the smallest typeclass constraint that supports the needed operations.\n- Keep effects as values; do not execute effects in constructors or top-level vals.\n\n## References\n- Load `references/cats-effect-io.md` for documentation summary and patterns.\n- For concrete samples, read `references/cats-effect-io.md`.\n- Use the `cats-effect-resource` skill for Resource-specific workflows and patterns (install: `npx skills add https://github.com/alexandru/skills --skill cats-effect-resource`).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:09:00.978Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Scala and Java Agents needing efficient side effect management and resource handling","zh":"适合于需要高效的副作用管理和资源处理的Scala和Java代理","ja":"副作用管理とリソースハンドリングが効率的である必要があるScalaとJavaエージェントに適しています","ko":"효율적인 부작용 관리와 리소스 처리가 필요한 Scala 및 Java 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes Scala y Java que necesitan una gestión eficiente de efectos laterales y manejo de recursos","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Scala et Java nécessitant une gestion efficace des effets secondaires et de la gestion des ressources","de":"Ideal für Scala- und Java-Agents, die eine effiziente Verwaltung von Nebeneffekten und Ressourcenhandhabung benötigen","pt":"Ideal para agentes Scala e Java que necessitam de gerenciamento eficiente de efeitos colaterais e manipulação de recursos","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Scala и Java, которым требуется эффективное управление побочными эффектами и обработка ресурсов","ar":"مثالي لعميل Scala و Java الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة فعالة للآثار الجانبية ومعالجة الموارد"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage side effects and resources efficiently using IO[A], SyncIO[A], and F[A] with Sync/Async/Temporal, while leveraging Resource for acquisition and release, and IOApp for program entry points, all within the JVM ecosystem using cats-effect-io","zh":"赋予代理高效地管理副作用和资源的能力，使用IO[A]、SyncIO[A]和F[A]，同时利用Sync/Async/Temporal，并利用Resource进行资源的获取和释放，利用IOApp进行程序入口点的管理，所有这些都在JVM生态系统中使用cats-effect-io","ja":"エージェントに副作用とリソースを効率的に管理する能力を与え、IO[A]、SyncIO[A]、F[A]を使用し、Sync/Async/Temporalを利用し、Resourceを使用してリソースを取得および解放し、IOAppを使用してプログラムのエントリポイントを管理し、すべてこれらをJVMエコシステムで使用するcats-effect-io","ko":"에이전트가 부작용과 리소스를 효율적으로 관리할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, IO[A], SyncIO[A], F[A]를 사용하고, Sync/Async/Temporal을 활용하고, Resource를 사용하여 리소스를 획득 및 릴리스하고, IOApp를 사용하여 프로그램入口점을 관리하며, 모든 이러한 것들은 JVM 생태계에서 cats-effect-io를 사용함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar los efectos laterales y los recursos de manera eficiente utilizando IO[A], SyncIO[A] y F[A] con Sync/Async/Temporal, aprovechando Resource para la adquisición y liberación, y IOApp para puntos de entrada de programas, todo dentro del ecosistema JVM utilizando cats-effect-io","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les effets secondaires et les ressources de manière efficace en utilisant IO[A], SyncIO[A] et F[A] avec Sync/Async/Temporal, en exploitant Resource pour l''acquisition et la libération, et IOApp pour les points d''entrée des programmes, le tout dans l''écosystème JVM en utilisant cats-effect-io","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, Nebeneffekte und Ressourcen effizient zu verwalten, indem sie IO[A], SyncIO[A] und F[A] mit Sync/Async/Temporal verwenden, während sie Resource für die Beschaffung und Freigabe und IOApp für Programm-Einstiegspunkte nutzen, alles innerhalb des JVM-Ökosystems unter Verwendung von cats-effect-io","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar efeitos colaterais e recursos de forma eficiente usando IO[A], SyncIO[A], e F[A] com Sync/Async/Temporal, aproveitando Resource para aquisição e liberação, e IOApp para pontos de entrada de programa, tudo dentro do ecossistema JVM usando cats-effect-io","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно управлять побочными эффектами и ресурсами с помощью IO[A], SyncIO[A] и F[A] с Sync/Async/Temporal, используя Resource для получения и освобождения ресурсов, и IOApp для точек входа программ, все в экосистеме JVM с использованием cats-effect-io","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إدارة الآثار الجانبية والموارد بفعالية باستخدام IO[A] و SyncIO[A] و F[A] مع Sync/Async/Temporal، واستخدام Resource للحصول والإصدار، واستخدام IOApp لنقاط الدخول البرمجية، كل ذلك داخل نظام JVM باستخدام cats-effect-io"},"useCases":{"en":["Wrapping Java blocking calls with IO.blocking or IO.interruptible for non-blocking operations","Implementing structured concurrency using parTraverse, parMapN, background, and Supervisor for efficient fiber management","Acquiring and releasing resources efficiently using Resource and IOApp for program entry points"],"zh":["使用IO.blocking或IO.interruptible将Java阻塞调用包装为非阻塞操作","使用parTraverse、parMapN、background和Supervisor实现结构化并发以实现高效的纤维管理","使用Resource和IOApp实现资源的高效获取和释放以及程序入口点"],"ja":["IO.blockingまたはIO.interruptibleを使用してJavaのブロッキング呼び出しを非ブロッキング操作にラップする","parTraverse、parMapN、background、Supervisorを使用して構造化された並行性を実装し、効率的なファイバ管理を実現する","ResourceとIOAppを使用してリソースの効率的な取得と解放、およびプログラムのエントリポイントを実現する"],"ko":["IO.blocking 또는 IO.interruptible을 사용하여 자바 블로킹 호출을 비블로킹 작동으로 래핑","parTraverse, parMapN, background, Supervisor를 사용하여 구조화된 병렬성을 구현하여 효율적인 파이버 관리를 실현","Resource와 IOApp를 사용하여 리소스의 효율적인 획득과 릴리스 및 프로그램入口점을 실현"],"es":["Envolver llamadas a bloqueos de Java con IO.blocking o IO.interruptible para operaciones no bloqueantes","Implementar concurrencia estructurada utilizando parTraverse, parMapN, background y Supervisor para una gestión eficiente de fibras","Adquirir y liberar recursos de manera eficiente utilizando Resource y IOApp para puntos de entrada de programas"],"fr":["Envelopper les appels de blocage Java avec IO.blocking ou IO.interruptible pour des opérations non bloquantes","Mettre en œuvre une concurrence structurée en utilisant parTraverse, parMapN, background et Supervisor pour une gestion efficace des fibres","Acquérir et libérer des ressources de manière efficace en utilisant Resource et IOApp pour les points d''entrée des programmes"],"de":["Java-Blockieraufrufe mit IO.blocking oder IO.interruptible für nicht blockierende Operationen umhüllen","Strukturierte Konkurrenz mithilfe von parTraverse, parMapN, background und Supervisor für eine effiziente Faserverwaltung implementieren","Ressourcen effizient mithilfe von Resource und IOApp für Programm-Einstiegspunkte erwerben und freigeben"],"pt":["Envolver chamadas Java bloqueadoras com IO.blocking ou IO.interruptible para operações não bloqueadoras","Implementar concorrência estruturada usando parTraverse, parMapN, background e Supervisor para gerenciamento eficiente de fibras","Adquirir e liberar recursos de forma eficiente usando Resource e IOApp para pontos de entrada de programa"],"ru":["Оборачивать блокирующие вызовы Java с помощью IO.blocking или IO.interruptible для неблокирующих операций","Реализовывать структурированную конкурентность с помощью parTraverse, parMapN, background и Supervisor для эффективного управления волокнами","Приобретать и освобождать ресурсы эффективно с помощью Resource и IOApp для точек входа программ"],"ar":["التغليف المكالمات الجافا المحظورة مع IO.blocking أو IO.interruptible للعمليات غير المحظورة","تنفيذ التزامن المنظم باستخدام parTraverse و parMapN و background و Supervisor لإدارة الألياف الفعالة","الحصول والإصدار الفعال للموارد باستخدام Resource و IOApp لنقاط الدخول البرمجية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires JVM environment","Primarily designed for Scala and Java developers","Needs understanding of Sync, Async, and Temporal type classes"],"zh":["需要JVM环境","主要针对Scala和Java开发人员设计","需要了解Sync、Async和Temporal类型类"],"ja":["JVMエコシステムが必要","主にScalaとJavaの開発者向けに設計されています","Sync、Async、Temporalタイプクラスの理解が必要"],"ko":["JVM 환경이 필요","주로 Scala 및 자바 개발자를 위한 설계","Sync, Async, Temporal 타입 클래스에 대한 이해가 필요"],"es":["Requiere un entorno JVM","Diseñado principalmente para desarrolladores de Scala y Java","Necesita comprensión de las clases de tipo Sync, Async y Temporal"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement JVM","Conçu principalement pour les développeurs Scala et Java","Nécessite une compréhension des classes de type Sync, Async et Temporal"],"de":["Benötigt eine JVM-Umgebung","Hauptsächlich für Scala- und Java-Entwickler konzipiert","Benötigt ein Verständnis der Sync-, Async- und Temporal-Typklassen"],"pt":["Requer ambiente JVM","Projetado principalmente para desenvolvedores Scala e Java","Exige compreensão das classes de tipo Sync, Async e Temporal"],"ru":["Требует среды JVM","В основном предназначен для разработчиков Scala и Java","Требует понимания типов классов Sync, Async и Temporal"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة JVM","تم تصميمه في المقام الأول لمطوري Scala و Java","يتطلب فهمًا للفئات النوعية Sync و Async و Temporal"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"15ec2b761ffb635bf0832379d39c0dc3eb703236060d04a2ac3ca10f07266384","qualityScore":38}');
