INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('kanzifucius/kindplane/create-branch', 'create-branch', 'kanzifucius', 'kindplane', 'community', 'create-branch kanzifucius kindplane community The create-branch skill bootstraps Kind clusters with Crossplane, providers, and essential components, benefiting developers working with CLI tools and Git version control. create-branch是一种CLI工具，用于使用Crossplane、提供者和必备组件来引导Kind集群。它可以分析未提交的更改，并创建一个适当命名的分支 create-branchは、Crossplane、プロバイダーおよび基本コンポーネントを使用してKindクラスターをブートストラップするCLIツールです。未コミットの変更を分析し、適切な名前のブランチを作成します create-branch는 Crossplane, 공급자 및 필수 구성 요소를 사용하여 Kind 클러스터를 부트스트랩하는 CLI 도구입니다. 커밋되지 않은 변경 사항을 분석하고 적절한 이름의 분기를 생성합니다 create-branch es una herramienta de línea de comandos para inicializar clusters de Kind con Crossplane, proveedores y componentes esenciales create-branch est un outil de ligne de commande pour configurer des clusters Kind avec Crossplane, des fournisseurs et des composants essentiels create-branch ist ein CLI-Tool zum Bootstrappen von Kind-Clustern mit Crossplane, Anbietern und wesentlichen Komponenten O Create-Branch é uma ferramenta CLI que bootstrap Kind clusters com Crossplane, provedores e componentes essenciais. Analisa as alterações não commitadas e cria um branch bem nomeado com um commit apropriado Create-Branch - это ИИ Агент, который bootstrap Kind clusters с Crossplane, провайдерами и необходимыми компонентами. Анализирует незакоммиченные изменения и создает хорошо именованный branch с соответствующим коммитом Create-Branch هو أداة سطر أوامر لتحميل Clusters Kind مع Crossplane ومزودي الخدمات والمكونات الأساسية. يتحليل التغييرات غير الملتزمة وينشئ فرعًا مُسمى جيدًا مع تعهد مناسب how to use create-branch create-branch setup guide Kind clusters bootstrap Crossplane providers setup create-branch alternative create-branch vs Git Flow create-branch install what is create-branch create-branch CLI tool create-branch Kind集群 Crossplane 提供者 CLI工具 git status git diff AIエージェント 自动化分支创建 Analyzes uncommitted changes using `git status` and `git diff` Creates well-named branches based on modified, added, and deleted files Supports understanding of changes through reading modified files Determines branch names based on the scope and purpose of modifications Commits changes with appropriate messages create-branch is a CLI tool that analyzes uncommitted changes in the current working directory and creates a well-named branch with an appropriate commit.');
