"],"de":["Leistungsverbesserung von Listen und Scrollen","Implementierung von Animationen mit Reanimated","Arbeit mit Bildern und Medien","Konfiguration von nativen Modulen und Schriftarten","Strukturierung von Monorepo-Projekten mit na"],"pt":["Otimização de listas e rolagem","Implementação de animações com Reanimated","Trabalho com imagens e mídia","Configuração de módulos nativos ou fontes","Estruturação de projetos monorepo com na"],"ru":["Оптимизация списков и прокрутки","Реализация анимаций с помощью Reanimated","Работа с изображениями и медиа","Настройка родных модулей или шрифтов","Структуризация проектов monorepo с na"],"ar":["تحسين القوائم والتمرير","تنفيذ Animations باستخدام Reanimated","العمل مع الصور ووسائل الإعلام","تكوين الوحدات الأصلية أو الخطوط","هيكلة مشاريع monorepo مع na"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use vercel-react-native-skills","what is vercel-react-native-skills","vercel-react-native-skills setup guide","vercel-react-native-skills vs react native cli","react native performance optimization","expo app development best practices","vercel-react-native-skills install","react native animations with reanimated","vercel-react-native-skills alternative"],"zh":["Vercel React Native","React Native 优化","Expo 项目结构","Reanimated 动画","UI 模式","平台特定优化","AI エージェント","React Native 最佳实践"],"ja":["Vercel React Native","React Native 最適化","Expo プロジェクト構造","Reanimated 動画","UI パターン","プラットフォーム特有の最適化","AI エージェント","React Native ベストプラクティス"],"ko":["Vercel React Native","React Native 최적화","Expo 프로젝트 구조","Reanimated 애니메이션","UI 패턴","플랫폼 특정 최적화","AI 에이전트","React Native 최적화 방법"],"es":["Vercel React Native","mejores prácticas React Native","optimización de rendimiento React Native","animaciones React Native","Expo aplicaciones","desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles","herramientas de desarrollo React Native"],"fr":["Vercel React Native","meilleures pratiques React Native","optimisation des performances React Native","animations React Native","applications Expo","développement d''applications mobiles","outils de développement React Native"],"de":["Vercel React Native","bewährte Methoden React Native","Leistungsverbesserung React Native","Animationen React Native","Expo-Anwendungen","Entwicklung von mobilen Anwendungen","Entwicklertools React Native"],"pt":["Vercel React Native","React Native otimização","Expo otimização","Reanimated","otimização de listas","otimização de rolagem","configuração de módulos nativos"],"ru":["Vercel React Native","Оптимизация React Native","Оптимизация Expo","Reanimated","Оптимизация списков","Оптимизация прокрутки","Настройка родных модулей"],"ar":["Vercel React Native","تحسين React Native","تحسين Expo","Reanimated","تحسين القوائم","تحسين التمرير","تكوين الوحدات الأصلية"]}},"owner":"theonizs","repo":"my-pearl-page","repoPath":"theonizs/my-pearl-page","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.533Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-react-native-skills","description":"","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# React Native Skills\n\nComprehensive best practices for React Native and Expo applications. Contains\nrules across multiple categories covering performance, animations, UI patterns,\nand platform-specific optimizations.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n\n- Building React Native or Expo apps\n- Optimizing list and scroll performance\n- Implementing animations with Reanimated\n- Working with images and media\n- Configuring native modules or fonts\n- Structuring monorepo projects with na","body":"# React Native Skills\n\nComprehensive best practices for React Native and Expo applications. Contains\nrules across multiple categories covering performance, animations, UI patterns,\nand platform-specific optimizations.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n\n- Building React Native or Expo apps\n- Optimizing list and scroll performance\n- Implementing animations with Reanimated\n- Working with images and media\n- Configuring native modules or fonts\n- Structuring monorepo projects with native dependencies\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category         | Impact   | Prefix               |\n| -------- | ---------------- | -------- | -------------------- |\n| 1        | List Performance | CRITICAL | `list-performance-`  |\n| 2        | Animation        | HIGH     | `animation-`         |\n| 3        | Navigation       | HIGH     | `navigation-`        |\n| 4        | UI Patterns      | HIGH     | `ui-`                |\n| 5        | State Management | MEDIUM   | `react-state-`       |\n| 6        | Rendering        | MEDIUM   | `rendering-`         |\n| 7        | Monorepo         | MEDIUM   | `monorepo-`          |\n| 8        | Configuration    | LOW      | `fonts-`, `imports-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. List Performance (CRITICAL)\n\n- `list-performance-virtualize` - Use FlashList for large lists\n- `list-performance-item-memo` - Memoize list item components\n- `list-performance-callbacks` - Stabilize callback references\n- `list-performance-inline-objects` - Avoid inline style objects\n- `list-performance-function-references` - Extract functions outside render\n- `list-performance-images` - Optimize images in lists\n- `list-performance-item-expensive` - Move expensive work outside items\n- `list-performance-item-types` - Use item types for heterogeneous lists\n\n### 2. Animation (HIGH)\n\n- `animation-gpu-properties` - Animate only transform and opacity\n- `animation-derived-value` - Use useDerivedValue for computed animations\n- `animation-gesture-detector-press` - Use Gesture.Tap instead of Pressable\n\n### 3. Navigation (HIGH)\n\n- `navigation-native-navigators` - Use native stack and native tabs over JS navigators\n\n### 4. UI Patterns (HIGH)\n\n- `ui-expo-image` - Use expo-image for all images\n- `ui-image-gallery` - Use Galeria for image lightboxes\n- `ui-pressable` - Use Pressable over TouchableOpacity\n- `ui-safe-area-scroll` - Handle safe areas in ScrollViews\n- `ui-scrollview-content-inset` - Use contentInset for headers\n- `ui-menus` - Use native context menus\n- `ui-native-modals` - Use native modals when possible\n- `ui-measure-views` - Use onLayout, not measure()\n- `ui-styling` - Use StyleSheet.create or Nativewind\n\n### 5. State Management (MEDIUM)\n\n- `react-state-minimize` - Minimize state subscriptions\n- `react-state-dispatcher` - Use dispatcher pattern for callbacks\n- `react-state-fallback` - Show fallback on first render\n- `react-compiler-destructure-functions` - Destructure for React Compiler\n- `react-compiler-reanimated-shared-values` - Handle shared values with compiler\n\n### 6. Rendering (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rendering-text-in-text-component` - Wrap text in Text components\n- `rendering-no-falsy-and` - Avoid falsy && for conditional rendering\n\n### 7. Monorepo (MEDIUM)\n\n- `monorepo-native-deps-in-app` - Keep native dependencies in app package\n- `monorepo-single-dependency-versions` - Use single versions across packages\n\n### 8. Configuration (LOW)\n\n- `fonts-config-plugin` - Use config plugins for custom fonts\n- `imports-design-system-folder` - Organize design system imports\n- `js-hoist-intl` - Hoist Intl object creation\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/list-performance-virtualize.md\nrules/animation-gpu-properties.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:11:08.693Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Mobile App Agents needing advanced React Native and Expo application optimization capabilities.","zh":"适合需要高级 React Native 和 Expo 应用优化能力的移动应用代理。","ja":"React Native および Expo アプリの高度な最適化機能を必要とするモバイル アプリ エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 React Native 및 Expo 애플리케이션 최적화 기능이 필요한 모바일 앱 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Aplicaciones Móviles que necesitan capacidades de optimización avanzadas de React Native y Expo.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''applications mobiles ayant besoin de capacités d''optimisation avancées de React Native et Expo.","de":"Perfekt für Mobile App-Agents, die erweiterte React Native- und Expo-Anwendungsoptimierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Aplicativos Móveis que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de otimização de aplicativos React Native e Expo.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Мобильных Приложений-агентов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности оптимизации приложений React Native и Expo.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطبيقات المحمولة الذي يحتاج إلى مهارات متقدمة لتحسين أداء التطبيقات React Native و Expo."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize React Native performance, implement animations with Reanimated, and configure native modules for improved user experience, leveraging best practices for list and scroll performance, UI patterns, and platform-specific optimizations.","zh":"赋予代理优化 React Native 性能、使用 Reanimated 实现动画并为改善用户体验而配置本机模块的能力，利用列表和滚动性能、UI 模式以及平台特定优化的最佳实践。","ja":"エージェントに React Native のパフォーマンスを最適化し、Reanimated を使用してアニメーションを実装し、ユーザー エクスペリエンスの向上のためにネイティブ モジュールを構成する能力を与え、リストとスクロールのパフォーマンス、UI パターン、およびプラットフォーム固有の最適化のベスト プラクティスを活用します。","ko":"에이전트가 React Native 성능을 최적화하고 Reanimated를 사용하여 애니메이션을 구현하며 사용자 경험을 향상하기 위해 네이티브 모듈을 구성할 수 있도록 하여 목록 및 스크롤 성능, UI 패턴 및 플랫폼별 최적화에 대한 모범 사례를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar el rendimiento de React Native, implementar animaciones con Reanimated y configurar módulos nativos para una mejor experiencia del usuario, aprovechando las mejores prácticas para el rendimiento de listas y desplazamiento, patrones de IU y optimizaciones específicas de la plataforma.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les performances de React Native, de mettre en œuvre des animations avec Reanimated et de configurer des modules natifs pour une expérience utilisateur améliorée, en exploitant les meilleures pratiques pour les performances de liste et de défilement, les modèles d''interface utilisateur et les optimisations spécifiques à la plateforme.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Leistung von React Native zu optimieren, Animationen mit Reanimated zu implementieren und native Module für eine verbesserte Benutzeroberfläche zu konfigurieren, indem es bewährte Verfahren für die Leistung von Listen und Scrollen, Benutzeroberflächenmuster und plattformspezifische Optimierungen nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar o desempenho do React Native, implementar animações com Reanimated e configurar módulos nativos para melhorar a experiência do usuário, aproveitando as melhores práticas para desempenho de lista e rolagem, padrões de UI e otimizações específicas de plataforma.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать производительность React Native, реализовывать анимации с помощью Reanimated и настраивать родные модули для улучшения пользовательского опыта, используя лучшие практики для производительности списка и прокрутки, шаблонов UI и платформенно-специфических оптимизаций.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تحسين أداء React Native، وتنفيذ Animations باستخدام Reanimated، وتهيئة الوحدات الأصلية لتحسين تجربة المستخدم، واستخدام أفضل الممارسات لأداء القائمة والتمرير، وأنماط الواجهة، والتحسينات المحددة بالأجهزة."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing list and scroll performance in React Native apps","Implementing animations with Reanimated for enhanced user interface","Configuring native modules and fonts for platform-specific optimizations"],"zh":["在 React Native 应用中优化列表和滚动性能","使用 Reanimated 实现增强的用户界面动画","配置本机模块和字体以实现平台特定优化"],"ja":["React Native アプリのリストとスクロールのパフォーマンスを最適化する","Reanimated を使用して強化されたユーザー インターフェイスのアニメーションを実装する","ネイティブ モジュールとフォントを構成してプラットフォーム固有の最適化を実現する"],"ko":["React Native 애플리케이션에서 목록 및 스크롤 성능을 최적화하는 것","Reanimated를 사용하여 강화된 사용자 인터페이스 애니메이션을 구현하는 것","네이티브 모듈 및 글꼴을 구성하여 플랫폼별 최적화를实现하는 것"],"es":["Optimizar el rendimiento de listas y desplazamiento en aplicaciones React Native","Implementar animaciones con Reanimated para una interfaz de usuario mejorada","Configurar módulos nativos y fuentes para optimizaciones específicas de la plataforma"],"fr":["Optimiser les performances de liste et de défilement dans les applications React Native","Mettre en œuvre des animations avec Reanimated pour une interface utilisateur améliorée","Configurer des modules natifs et des polices pour des optimisations spécifiques à la plateforme"],"de":["Optimieren des Listen- und Scroll-Performances in React Native-Apps","Implementieren von Animationen mit Reanimated für eine verbesserte Benutzeroberfläche","Konfigurieren von nativen Modulen und Schriftarten für plattformspezifische Optimierungen"],"pt":["Otimizando o desempenho de lista e rolagem em aplicativos React Native","Implementando animações com Reanimated para interface do usuário aprimorada","Configurando módulos nativos e fontes para otimizações específicas de plataforma"],"ru":["Оптимизация производительности списка и прокрутки в приложениях React Native","Реализация анимаций с помощью Reanimated для улучшения пользовательского интерфейса","Настройка родных модулей и шрифтов для платформенно-специфических оптимизаций"],"ar":["تحسين أداء القائمة والتمرير في تطبيقات React Native","تنفيذ Animations باستخدام Reanimated لتحسين واجهة المستخدم","تهيئة الوحدات الأصلية والأحرف لتحسينات محددة بالأجهزة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React Native or Expo application environment","Specific to React Native and Expo ecosystems"],"zh":["需要 React Native 或 Expo 应用环境","仅限 React Native 和 Expo 生态系统"],"ja":["React Native または Expo アプリの環境が必要","React Native および Expo エコシステムに特有"],"ko":["React Native 또는 Expo 애플리케이션 환경이 필요함","React Native 및 Expo 생태계에만 특정"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de aplicación React Native o Expo","Específico de los ecosistemas React Native y Expo"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement d''application React Native ou Expo","Spécifique aux écosystèmes React Native et Expo"],"de":["Benötigt eine React Native- oder Expo-Anwendungsumgebung","Spezifisch für die React Native- und Expo-Ökosysteme"],"pt":["Requer ambiente de aplicativo React Native ou Expo","Específico para ecossistemas React Native e Expo"],"ru":["Требует среды приложения React Native или Expo","Специфичен для экосистем React Native и Expo"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة تطبيق React Native أو Expo","محدد لنظامي React Native و Expo"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"4012750a5ccbe064ca04af3835d5d1b011979d2d09d9b6df1c8128fac58e0a66","qualityScore":38}');
