ui es un skill que permite personalizar la interfaz de usuario de Clerk y crear flujos de autenticación personalizados","fr":"clerk-custom-ui est un skill qui permet de personnaliser l''interface utilisateur de Clerk et de créer des flux d''authentification personnalisés","de":"clerk-custom-ui ist ein Skill, der die Anpassung der Benutzeroberfläche von Clerk und die Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Authentifizierungsflüssen ermöglicht","pt":"O Clerk Custom UI é um skill que permite personalizar a interface do usuário do Clerk.","ru":"Clerk Custom UI — умение, которое позволяет настроить интерфейс пользователя Clerk ИИ Агентов.","ar":"Clerk Custom UI هو مهارة يسمح بتخصيص واجهة المستخدم في Clerk لمنصة الإي آي أدوات"},"features":{"en":["Build custom authentication flows using hooks","Customize the appearance of Clerk''s pre-built components","Theme and style Clerk''s components to match your brand","Use the ClerkProvider to wrap your app","Check package.json for the SDK version","Reference custom flow tables for setup"],"zh":["自定义身份验证流程","外观定制","使用 React 和 JavaScript","支持 ClerkProvider","版本检查","自定义流程引用"],"ja":["独自の認証フロー","外観カスタマイズ","React と JavaScript を使用","ClerkProvider をサポート","バージョンチェック","カスタムフロー参照"],"ko":["사용자 지정 인증 흐름","외관 맞춤 설정","React와 JavaScript 사용","ClerkProvider 지원","버전 확인","사용자 지정 흐름 참조"],"es":["Personalización de la interfaz de usuario de Clerk","Creación de flujos de autenticación personalizados con hooks","Customización de la apariencia de los componentes preconstruidos de Clerk","Compatibilidad con diferentes versiones del SDK de Clerk","Uso de ClerkProvider para envolver la aplicación"],"fr":["Personnalisation de l''interface utilisateur de Clerk","Création de flux d''authentification personnalisés avec des hooks","Customisation de l''apparence des composants préconstruits de Clerk","Compatibilité avec différentes versions du SDK de Clerk","Utilisation de ClerkProvider pour envelopper l''application"],"de":["Anpassung der Benutzeroberfläche von Clerk","Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Authentifizierungsflüssen mit Hooks","Anpassung der Oberfläche der vorgefertigten Komponenten von Clerk","Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen Versionen des Clerk-SDK","Verwendung von ClerkProvider zum Umhüllen der Anwendung"],"pt":["Criação de fluxos de autenticação personalizados","Customização da aparência do Clerk","Uso de hooks para personalizar a interface do usuário","Compatibilidade com diferentes versões do SDK","Integração com o ClerkProvider","Personalização de temas e estilos"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских потоков аутентификации","Настройка внешнего вида Clerk ИИ Агентов","Использование хуков для настройки интерфейса пользователя","Совместимость с разными версиями SDK","Интеграция с ClerkProvider","Настройка тем и стилей"],"ar":["إنشاء تدفقات مصادقة مخصصة","تخصيص المظهر في Clerk لمنصة الإي آي أدوات","استخدام Hooks لتخصيص واجهة المستخدم","التأقلم مع إصدارات SDK المختلفة","التكامل مع ClerkProvider","تخصيص السمات والأشكال"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use clerk-custom-ui","clerk-custom-ui setup guide","custom authentication flow examples","clerk-custom-ui vs competing UI libraries","clerk-custom-ui install","what is clerk-custom-ui","clerk-custom-ui documentation","clerk-custom-ui tutorial","clerk-custom-ui alternative"],"zh":["Clerk 自定义 UI","AIエージェント","身份验证流程","外观定制","React","JavaScript","ClerkProvider","版本检查"],"ja":["Clerk カスタム UI","AIエージェント","認証フロー","外観カスタマイズ","React","JavaScript","ClerkProvider","バージョンチェック"],"ko":["Clerk Custom UI","AI 도구","인증 흐름","외관 맞춤 설정","React","JavaScript","ClerkProvider","버전 확인"],"es":["clerk-custom-ui","autenticación personalizada","interfaz de usuario personalizada","hooks de autenticación","ClerkProvider","SDK de Clerk","desarrollo de aplicaciones web","autenticación y autorización","personalización de la interfaz de usuario"],"fr":["clerk-custom-ui","authentification personnalisée","interface utilisateur personnalisée","hooks d''authentification","ClerkProvider","SDK de Clerk","développement d''applications web","authentification et autorisation","personnalisation de l''interface utilisateur"],"de":["clerk-custom-ui","benutzerdefinierte Authentifizierung","benutzerdefinierte Benutzeroberfläche","Authentifizierungs-Hooks","ClerkProvider","Clerk-SDK","Webanwendungs-Entwicklung","Authentifizierung und Autorisierung","Anpassung der Benutzeroberfläche"],"pt":["Clerk Custom UI","autenticação personalizada","customização de interface do usuário","hooks","ClerkProvider","SDK","desenvolvedores","Guia de configuração","personalização de temas","estilos personalizados"],"ru":["Clerk Custom UI","пользовательские потоки аутентификации","настройка интерфейса пользователя","хуки","ClerkProvider","SDK","разработчики","Руководство по настройке","настройка тем","пользовательские стили ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["Clerk Custom UI","تدفقات مصادقة مخصصة","تخصيص واجهة المستخدم","Hooks","ClerkProvider","SDK","مطورين","دليل التثبيت","تخصيص السمات","أشكال مخصصة لمنصة الإي آي أدوات"]}},"owner":"mihaicrisan04","repo":"zalem","repoPath":"mihaicrisan04/zalem","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-07T22:03:44Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"clerk-custom-ui","description":"Custom authentication flows and component appearance - hooks (useSignIn, useSignUp), themes, colors, fonts, CSS. Use for custom sign-in/sign-up flows, appearance styling, visual customization, branding.","version":"2.1.0","bodyPreview":"# Custom UI\n\n> **Prerequisite**: Ensure `ClerkProvider` wraps your app. See `setup/`.\n>\n> **Version**: Check `package.json` for the SDK version — see `clerk` skill for the version table. This determines which custom flow references to use below.\n\nThis skill covers two areas:\n\n1. **Custom authentication flows** — build your own sign-in/sign-up UI with hooks\n2. **Appearance customization** — theme, style, and brand Clerk''s pre-built components\n\n## Custom Flow References\n\n| Task","body":"# Custom UI\n\n> **Prerequisite**: Ensure `ClerkProvider` wraps your app. See `setup/`.\n>\n> **Version**: Check `package.json` for the SDK version — see `clerk` skill for the version table. This determines which custom flow references to use below.\n\nThis skill covers two areas:\n\n1. **Custom authentication flows** — build your own sign-in/sign-up UI with hooks\n2. **Appearance customization** — theme, style, and brand Clerk''s pre-built components\n\n## Custom Flow References\n\n| Task                       | Core 2                                           | Current                    |\n| -------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ | -------------------------- |\n| Custom sign-in (useSignIn) | `core-2/custom-sign-in.md`                       | `core-3/custom-sign-in.md` |\n| Custom sign-up (useSignUp) | `core-2/custom-sign-up.md`                       | `core-3/custom-sign-up.md` |\n| `<Show>` component         | _(use `<SignedIn>`, `<SignedOut>`, `<Protect>`)_ | `core-3/show-component.md` |\n\n---\n\n## Appearance Customization\n\nAppearance customization applies to both Core 2 and the current SDK.\n\n### Component Customization Options\n\n| Task                               | Documentation                                                                             |\n| ---------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Appearance prop overview           | https://clerk.com/docs/nextjs/guides/customizing-clerk/appearance-prop/overview           |\n| Options (structure, logo, buttons) | https://clerk.com/docs/nextjs/guides/customizing-clerk/appearance-prop/layout             |\n| Themes (pre-built dark/light)      | https://clerk.com/docs/nextjs/guides/customizing-clerk/appearance-prop/themes             |\n| Variables (colors, fonts, spacing) | https://clerk.com/docs/nextjs/guides/customizing-clerk/appearance-prop/variables          |\n| CAPTCHA configuration              | https://clerk.com/docs/nextjs/guides/customizing-clerk/appearance-prop/captcha            |\n| Bring your own CSS                 | https://clerk.com/docs/nextjs/guides/customizing-clerk/appearance-prop/bring-your-own-css |\n\n### Appearance Pattern\n\n```typescript\n<SignIn\n  appearance={{\n    variables: {\n      colorPrimary: ''#0000ff'',\n      borderRadius: ''0.5rem'',\n    },\n    options: {\n      logoImageUrl: ''/logo.png'',\n      socialButtonsVariant: ''iconButton'',\n    },\n  }}\n/>\n```\n\n> **Core 2 ONLY (skip if current SDK):** The `options` property was named `layout`. Use `layout: { logoImageUrl: ''...'', socialButtonsVariant: ''...'' }` instead of `options`.\n\n### variables (colors, typography, borders)\n\n| Property          | Description                         |\n| ----------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `colorPrimary`    | Primary color throughout            |\n| `colorBackground` | Background color                    |\n| `borderRadius`    | Border radius (default: `0.375rem`) |\n\n**Opacity change:** `colorRing` and `colorModalBackdrop` now render at full opacity. Use explicit `rgba()` values if you need transparency.\n\n> **Core 2 ONLY (skip if current SDK):** `colorRing` and `colorModalBackdrop` rendered at 15% opacity by default.\n\n### options (structure, logo, social buttons)\n\n| Property                 | Description                                   |\n| ------------------------ | --------------------------------------------- |\n| `logoImageUrl`           | URL to custom logo                            |\n| `socialButtonsVariant`   | `''blockButton''` \\| `''iconButton''` \\| `''auto''` |\n| `socialButtonsPlacement` | `''top''` \\| `''bottom''`                         |\n| `showOptionalFields`     | Show optional fields (default: `false`)       |\n\n> **Core 2 ONLY (skip if current SDK):** This property is called `layout`, not `options`. Also, `showOptionalFields` defaulted to `true`.\n\n### Themes\n\nInstall themes from `@clerk/ui`:\n\n```bash\nnpm install @clerk/ui\n```\n\n```typescript\nimport { dark } from ''@clerk/ui/themes''\n\n<ClerkProvider appearance={{ theme: dark }} />\n```\n\n> **Core 2 ONLY (skip if current SDK):** Themes are imported from `@clerk/themes` (install `@clerk/themes` instead of `@clerk/ui`). Example: `import { dark } from ''@clerk/themes''`.\n\n**Theme stacking** — pass an array where the last theme takes precedence:\n\n```typescript\nimport { dark, neobrutalism } from ''@clerk/ui/themes''\n\n<ClerkProvider appearance={{ theme: [dark, neobrutalism] }} />\n```\n\n**CSS `color-scheme` support** — the default theme respects the CSS `color-scheme` property for automatic light/dark mode toggling.\n\n**Available themes:** `dark`, `neobrutalism`, `shadcn`, `simple`\n\n#### shadcn Theme (HIGH PRIORITY)\n\n> **IMPORTANT:** If the project has `components.json` (shadcn/ui installed), ALWAYS apply the shadcn theme as the FIRST customization step. This ensures Clerk components visually match the existing shadcn design system. Skip this only if the user explicitly requests a different theme.\n\n**If the project uses shadcn/ui** (check for `components.json` in the project root), **always use the shadcn theme**:\n\n```typescript\nimport { shadcn } from ''@clerk/ui/themes''\n\n<ClerkProvider appearance={{ theme: shadcn }} />\n```\n\nAlso import shadcn CSS in your global styles:\n\n```css\n@import \"tailwindcss\";\n@import \"@clerk/ui/themes/shadcn.css\";\n```\n\n> **Core 2 ONLY (skip if current SDK):** Import from `@clerk/themes` and `@clerk/themes/shadcn.css`:\n>\n> ```typescript\n> import { shadcn } from \"@clerk/themes\";\n> ```\n>\n> ```css\n> @import \"@clerk/themes/shadcn.css\";\n> ```\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Identify customization needs (custom flow or appearance)\n2. For custom flows: check SDK version → read appropriate `core-2/` or `core-3/` reference\n3. For appearance: WebFetch the appropriate documentation from table above\n4. Apply appearance prop to your Clerk components or build custom flow with hooks\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n| Issue                        | Solution                                                                                      |\n| ---------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Colors not applying          | Use `colorPrimary` not `primaryColor`                                                         |\n| Logo not showing             | Put `logoImageUrl` inside `options: {}` (or `layout: {}` in Core 2)                           |\n| Social buttons wrong         | Add `socialButtonsVariant: ''iconButton''` in `options` (or `layout` in Core 2)                 |\n| Styling not working          | Use appearance prop, not direct CSS (unless with bring-your-own-css)                          |\n| Hook returns different shape | Check SDK version — Core 2 and current have completely different `useSignIn`/`useSignUp` APIs |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:18:48.547Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring customized authentication flows and UI branding.","zh":"适用于需要自定义身份验证流程和UI品牌的前端代理。","ja":"カスタマイズされた認証フローとUIブランディングを必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに適しています。","ko":"사용자 지정 인증 흐름 및 UI 브랜딩이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes Frontend que requieren flujos de autenticación personalizados y marca de UI.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Frontend nécessitant des flux d''authentification personnalisés et une marque de UI.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die benutzerdefinierte Authentifizierungsflüsse und UI-Markierungen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend que exigem fluxos de autenticação personalizados e marcação de UI.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, требующих настраиваемых потоков аутентификации и брендинга UI.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يتطلب تدفقات مصادقة مخصصة وتسمية واجهة المستخدم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create tailored sign-in/sign-up experiences using custom hooks and theme Clerk''s pre-built components with SDK version-specific references from package.json, enabling seamless integration with ClerkProvider.","zh":"赋予代理创建定制的登录/注册体验的能力，使用自定义钩子和主题Clerk的预构建组件，使用package.json中的SDK版本特定引用，实现与ClerkProvider的无缝集成。","ja":"カスタムフックとテーマを使用してClerkの事前構築されたコンポーネントをテーマ化し、package.jsonからのSDKバージョン固有の参照を使用して、ClerkProviderとのシームレスな統合を可能にすることで、エージェントがカスタマイズされたサインイン/サインアップ体験を作成できるようにします。","ko":"カスタムフック와 테마를 사용하여 Clerk의 事前構築された コンポーネント를 테마화하고, package.jsonからの SDK 버전 고유의 참조를 사용하여, ClerkProvider와의 시ーム리스한 통합을 가능하게 함으로써, 에이전트가 사용자 지정된 로그인/등록 경험을 만들 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear experiencias de inicio de sesión/registro personalizadas utilizando ganchos personalizados y tema los componentes preconstruidos de Clerk con referencias específicas de la versión del SDK desde package.json, lo que permite una integración sin problemas con ClerkProvider.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des expériences de connexion/inscription personnalisées en utilisant des crochets personnalisés et en thématique les composants préconstruits de Clerk avec des références spécifiques à la version du SDK à partir de package.json, permettant ainsi une intégration transparente avec ClerkProvider.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, maßgeschneiderte Anmelde-/Registrierungserfahrungen mithilfe benutzerdefinierter Hooks und eines Themes für die vorgefertigten Komponenten von Clerk mit versionsspezifischen Referenzen aus package.json zu erstellen, wodurch eine nahtlose Integration mit ClerkProvider ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar experiências personalizadas de entrada/saída usando ganchos personalizados e tema os componentes pré-construídos do Clerk com referências de versão específica do SDK do package.json, permitindo uma integração perfeita com o ClerkProvider.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать адаптированные trải nghiệm входа/выхода с помощью пользовательских крючков и темы предварительно созданных компонентов Clerk с версиями SDK, указанными в package.json, обеспечивая бесшовную интеграцию с ClerkProvider.","ar":"يؤهل الوكلاء لإنشاء تجارب دخول/خروج مخصصة باستخدام مشابك مخصصة وتحديد مواضيع للمكونات المسبقة إنشاء من Clerk مع إشارات إلى إصدار SDK المحدد في package.json، وتمكين التكامل السلس مع ClerkProvider."},"useCases":{"en":["Customizing authentication flows for branded sign-in/sign-up UI","Theming Clerk''s pre-built components for consistent app appearance","Building custom UI components with hooks for advanced authentication workflows"],"zh":["为品牌化的登录/注册UI自定义身份验证流程","为一致的应用程序外观而对Clerk的预构建组件进行主题化","使用钩子构建自定义UI组件以实现高级身份验证工作流"],"ja":["ブランド化されたログイン/サインアップUIのためのカスタム認証フロー","一貫したアプリケーションの外観のためのClerkの事前構築されたコンポーネントのテーマ化","高級認証ワークフローを実現するためのカスタムUIコンポーネントの構築"],"ko":["브랜드화된 로그인/등록 UI를 위한 사용자 지정 인증 흐름","일관된 애플리케이션 외관을 위한 Clerk의 사전構築된 コンポーネント의 테마화","고급 인증 워크플로우를 구현하기 위한 사용자 지정 UI 컴포넌트의 구축"],"es":["Personalizar flujos de autenticación para UI de inicio de sesión/registro con marca","Tema los componentes preconstruidos de Clerk para una apariencia de aplicación coherente","Construir componentes de UI personalizados con ganchos para flujos de trabajo de autenticación avanzados"],"fr":["Personnaliser les flux d''authentification pour une UI de connexion/inscription avec marque","Thématique les composants préconstruits de Clerk pour une apparence d''application cohérente","Construire des composants UI personnalisés avec des crochets pour des flux de travail d''authentification avancés"],"de":["Anpassen von Authentifizierungsflüssen für eine UI für Anmeldung/Registrierung mit Markenimage","Vorgefertigte Komponenten von Clerk thematisieren, um ein konsistentes App-Erscheinungsbild zu gewährleisten","Erstellen benutzerdefinierter UI-Komponenten mit Hooks für erweiterte Authentifizierungsworkflows"],"pt":["Personalizar fluxos de autenticação para UI de entrada/saída com marca","Tema dos componentes pré-construídos do Clerk para uma aparência de aplicativo consistente","Construir componentes de UI personalizados com ganchos para fluxos de trabalho de autenticação avançados"],"ru":["Настройка потоков аутентификации для брендированного UI входа/выхода","Тема предварительно созданных компонентов Clerk для последовательного вида приложения","Создание пользовательских компонентов UI с крючками для расширенных рабочих процессов аутентификации"],"ar":["تخصيص تدفقات المصادقة لواجهة المستخدم للدخول/الخروج بالعلامة التجارية","تحديد مواضيع للمكونات المسبقة إنشاء من Clerk لمظهر تطبيق متسق","بناء مكونات واجهة المستخدم المخصصة مع المشابك لتدفقات العمل المصادقة المتقدمة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires ClerkProvider to wrap the app","SDK version determines custom flow references"],"zh":["需要ClerkProvider包裹应用程序","SDK版本决定自定义流程引用"],"ja":["ClerkProviderがアプリケーションをラップする必要がある","SDKバージョンがカスタムフローの参照を決定する"],"ko":["ClerkProvider가 애플리케이션을 감싸야 함","SDK 버전이 사용자 지정 흐름 참조를 결정함"],"es":["Requiere ClerkProvider para envolver la aplicación","La versión del SDK determina las referencias del flujo personalizado"],"fr":["Nécessite ClerkProvider pour envelopper l''application","La version du SDK détermine les références du flux personnalisé"],"de":["Benötigt ClerkProvider, um die App zu umschließen","Die SDK-Version bestimmt die Referenzen des benutzerdefinierten Flusses"],"pt":["Exige que o ClerkProvider envolva o aplicativo","A versão do SDK determina as referências de fluxo personalizado"],"ru":["Требует, чтобы ClerkProvider обернул приложение","Версия SDK определяет ссылки на пользовательский поток"],"ar":["يتطلب أن يحتوي ClerkProvider على التطبيق","تحديد إصدار SDK المراجع التي تدفق مخصص"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"edf74eede00053b2155da19b770cb28d69972a195745abae81006fd8e25e4434","qualityScore":38}');
