- und Zinsklauseln","Kompatibilität mit der WhatSp-API","Verwendung von MCP-Server-Technologien","Unterstützung für alternative Erleichterungsanträge"],"pt":["Geração de PRAYER_PACK.json com base em regras rigorosas","Uso de linguagem formal de tribunal","Inclusão de cláusula ''such other orders''","Suporte à API WhatSp","Compatibilidade com servidor MCP"],"ru":["Генерация PRAYER_PACK.json на основе строгих правил","Использование формального языка суда","Включение пункта ''such other orders''","Поддержка API WhatSp","Совместимость с сервером MCP"],"ar":["إنشاء PRAYER_PACK.json بناءً على قواعد صارمة","استخدام لغة محكمة رسمية","إدراج بند ''such other orders''","دعم API WhatSp","التوافق مع خادم MCP"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use prayer-agent","prayer-agent setup guide","prayer-agent vs Whatsp API","prayer-agent install","what is prayer-agent","prayer-agent alternative","prayer-agent MCP server","PRAYER_PACK.json generation","Whatsp API integration"],"zh":["Prayer Agent","MCP 服务器","Whatsp API","PRAYER_PACK.json","AI 工具","AI エージェント","法庭语言","技术集成"],"ja":["Prayer Agent","MCP サーバー","Whatsp API","PRAYER_PACK.json","AI エージェント","AI ツール","法廷言語","技術統合"],"ko":["Prayer Agent","MCP 서버","Whatsp API","PRAYER_PACK.json","AI 에이전트","AI 도구","법원 언어","기술 통합"],"es":["Prayer Agent","agente de inteligencia artificial","generación de PRAYER_PACK.json","reglas estrictas","lenguaje formal de tribunal","API de WhatSp","servidor MCP","solicitudes de alivio","cláusulas de costos e intereses"],"fr":["Prayer Agent","agent d''intelligence artificielle","génération de PRAYER_PACK.json","règles strictes","langage formel de tribunal","API WhatSp","serveur MCP","demandes de secours","clauses de coûts et d''intérêts"],"de":["Prayer Agent","künstlicher Intelligenzagent","Erstellung von PRAYER_PACK.json","strenge Regeln","formaler Gerichtssprachgebrauch","WhatSp-API","MCP-Server","Erleichterungsanträge","Kosten- und Zinsklauseln"],"pt":["Prayer-Agent","MCP Server","API WhatSp","PRAYER_PACK.json","linguagem formal de tribunal","regras rigorosas","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["ИИ Агент Prayer-Agent","Сервер MCP","API WhatSp","PRAYER_PACK.json","формальный язык суда","строгие правила","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["Prayer-Agent","خادم MCP","API WhatSp","PRAYER_PACK.json","لغة محكمة رسمية","قواعد صارمة","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"itmeGirish","repo":"BoardingMcp-Server","repoPath":"itmeGirish/BoardingMcp-Server","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-25T16:04:12Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"prayer-agent","description":"Generates correct prayers/reliefs (primary, alternative, interim) based on doc_type and issues.","bodyPreview":"# Prayer Agent\n\n## Goal\nGenerate PRAYER_PACK.json.\n\n## HARD RULES\n- Prayer must match doc_type.\n- Do not request illegal relief.\n- Always include \"such other orders\" clause.\n\n## OUTPUT CONTRACT (STRICT JSON ONLY)\nReturn ONLY:\n\n{\n  \"doc_type\": \"string\",\n  \"reliefs_primary\": [],\n  \"reliefs_alternative\": [],\n  \"interim_reliefs\": [],\n  \"costs_interest_clause\": \"string\"\n}\n\n## PRAYER STANDARDS\n- Use formal court language.\n- Use \"this Hon''ble Court\" phrasing.\n- Avoid aggressive accusations unless facts","body":"# Prayer Agent\n\n## Goal\nGenerate PRAYER_PACK.json.\n\n## HARD RULES\n- Prayer must match doc_type.\n- Do not request illegal relief.\n- Always include \"such other orders\" clause.\n\n## OUTPUT CONTRACT (STRICT JSON ONLY)\nReturn ONLY:\n\n{\n  \"doc_type\": \"string\",\n  \"reliefs_primary\": [],\n  \"reliefs_alternative\": [],\n  \"interim_reliefs\": [],\n  \"costs_interest_clause\": \"string\"\n}\n\n## PRAYER STANDARDS\n- Use formal court language.\n- Use \"this Hon''ble Court\" phrasing.\n- Avoid aggressive accusations unless facts support.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T03:59:17.234Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Legal AI Agents needing automated PRAYER_PACK.json generation for Whatsp API integration.","zh":"适合需要自动化生成PRAYER_PACK.json文件以便与Whatsp API集成的法律AI代理。","ja":"Whatsp APIとの統合ために自動的にPRAYER_PACK.jsonファイルを生成する必要がある法的AIエージェントに適しています。","ko":"Whatsp API와의 통합을 위해 자동으로 PRAYER_PACK.json 파일을 생성해야 하는 법률 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Inteligencia Artificial Legales que necesitan generación automática de PRAYER_PACK.json para integración con Whatsp API.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Intelligence Artificielle Juridiques ayant besoin d''une génération automatisée de PRAYER_PACK.json pour l''intégration à Whatsp API.","de":"Perfekt für Rechts-AI-Agenten, die eine automatisierte PRAYER_PACK.json-Generierung für die Whatsp-API-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Inteligência Artificial Jurídica que necessitam de geração automática de PRAYER_PACK.json para integração com a API Whatsp.","ru":"Идеально для юридических агентов ИИ, которым требуется автоматическая генерация PRAYER_PACK.json для интеграции с API Whatsp.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي القانوني الذين يحتاجون إلى توليد تلقائي لملف PRAYER_PACK.json لتكامل Whatsp API."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate strict JSON-formatted prayer packs with formal court language, including ''such other orders'' clauses and adhering to doc_type rules, using Whatsp API protocols and JSON output contracts.","zh":"赋予代理人生成严格的JSON格式的祈祷包的能力，包括正式的法院语言和''doc_type''规则，并使用Whatsp API协议和JSON输出契约。","ja":"形式的な法廷言語や''doc_type''ルールを含む厳密なJSON形式の祈祷パックを生成する能力をエージェントに与え、Whatsp APIプロトコルとJSON出力契約を使用します。","ko":"형식적인 법정 언어와 ''doc_type'' 규칙을 포함하는 엄격한 JSON 형식의祈祷 패키지를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 에이전트에게 부여하며, Whatsp API 프로토콜과 JSON 출력 계약을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar paquetes de oración estrictamente formateados en JSON con lenguaje formal de tribunal, incluyendo cláusulas de ''otras órdenes'' y que se adhieren a las reglas de doc_type, utilizando protocolos de Whatsp API y contratos de salida de JSON.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des paquets de prière strictement formatés en JSON avec un langage formel de tribunal, y compris des clauses ''autres ordres'' et qui respectent les règles de doc_type, en utilisant les protocoles de Whatsp API et les contrats de sortie JSON.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, strikt formatierte JSON-Gebetspakete mit formaler Gerichtssprache zu generieren, einschließlich ''sonstiger Anordnungen''-Klauseln und unter Einhaltung der doc_type-Regeln, unter Verwendung von Whatsp-API-Protokollen und JSON-Ausgabeverträgen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar pacotes de oração com formato JSON rigoroso, com linguagem formal de tribunal, incluindo cláusulas ''e outras ordens'' e que aderem às regras de doc_type, utilizando protocolos da API Whatsp e contratos de saída JSON.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать пакеты молитв в формате JSON с формальным языком суда, включая пункты ''и другие распоряжения'' и следуя правилам doc_type, используя протоколы API Whatsp и контракты вывода JSON.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية توليد حزم صلاة بالتنسيق JSON الصارم، مع لغة رسمية للمحكمة، بما في ذلك بنود ''وأوامر أخرى'' والامتثال لقواعد doc_type، باستخدام بروتوكولات Whatsp API وعقود الإخراج JSON."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating PRAYER_PACK.json files for legal professionals","Automating Whatsp API requests with properly formatted prayer packs","Creating standardized court documents with formal language"],"zh":["为法律专业人员生成PRAYER_PACK.json文件","使用格式化的祈祷包自动化Whatsp API请求","使用正式语言创建标准化的法院文件"],"ja":["法的専門家のためのPRAYER_PACK.jsonファイルを生成する","形式的な祈祷パックを使用してWhatsp APIリクエストを自動化する","正式な言語を使用して標準化された法廷文書を作成する"],"ko":["법률 전문가를 위한 PRAYER_PACK.json 파일 생성","서식이 된 祈祷 패키지를 사용하여 Whatsp API 요청 자동화","형식적인 언어를 사용하여 표준화된 법정 문서 생성"],"es":["Generación de archivos PRAYER_PACK.json para profesionales del derecho","Automatización de solicitudes de Whatsp API con paquetes de oración debidamente formateados","Creación de documentos estandarizados de tribunal con lenguaje formal"],"fr":["Génération de fichiers PRAYER_PACK.json pour les professionnels du droit","Automatisation des demandes d''API Whatsp avec des paquets de prière correctement formatés","Création de documents de tribunal standardisés avec un langage formel"],"de":["Generierung von PRAYER_PACK.json-Dateien für Rechtsanwälte","Automatisierung von Whatsp-API-Anfragen mit ordnungsgemäß formatierten Gebetspaketen","Erstellung standardisierter Gerichtsdokumente mit formaler Sprache"],"pt":["Geração de arquivos PRAYER_PACK.json para profissionais jurídicos","Automatização de solicitações da API Whatsp com pacotes de oração formatados corretamente","Criação de documentos padrão do tribunal com linguagem formal"],"ru":["Генерация файлов PRAYER_PACK.json для юридических специалистов","Автоматизация запросов API Whatsp с правильно отформатированными пакетами молитв","Создание стандартизированных документов суда с формальным языком"],"ar":["توليد ملفات PRAYER_PACK.json للمحترفين القانونيين","تأتمتة طلبات Whatsp API مع حزم صلاة منسقة بشكل صحيح","إنشاء مستندات محكمة معيارية بلغة رسمية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires strict adherence to HARD RULES and OUTPUT CONTRACT","Limited to generating PRAYER_PACK.json files only","Must use formal court language and avoid aggressive accusations"],"zh":["需要严格遵守HARD RULES和OUTPUT CONTRACT","仅限生成PRAYER_PACK.json文件","必须使用正式的法院语言并避免激进的指控"],"ja":["HARD RULESとOUTPUT CONTRACTを厳密に遵守する必要がある","PRAYER_PACK.jsonファイルの生成のみに限定される","形式的な法廷言語を使用し、激進的な非難を避けることが必要"],"ko":["HARD RULES와 OUTPUT CONTRACT를 엄격히 준수해야 함","PRAYER_PACK.json 파일 생성에만 제한됨","형식적인 법정 언어를 사용하고 과격한 고소를 피해야 함"],"es":["Requiere una estricta adherencia a las REGLAS DURAS y CONTRATO DE SALIDA","Limitado a la generación de archivos PRAYER_PACK.json solamente","Debe utilizar lenguaje formal de tribunal y evitar acusaciones agresivas"],"fr":["Nécessite une stricte adhésion aux RÈGLES DURES et au CONTRAT DE SORTIE","Limité à la génération de fichiers PRAYER_PACK.json uniquement","Doit utiliser un langage formel de tribunal et éviter les accusations agressives"],"de":["Erfordert eine strikte Einhaltung der HARTEN REGELN und des AUSGABEVERTRAGS","Begrenzt auf die Generierung von PRAYER_PACK.json-Dateien nur","Muss formale Gerichtssprache verwenden und aggressive Anschuldigungen vermeiden"],"pt":["Exige adesão rigorosa às REGRAS RÍGIDAS e CONTRATO DE SAÍDA","Limitado à geração de arquivos PRAYER_PACK.json apenas","Deve usar linguagem formal de tribunal e evitar acusações agressivas"],"ru":["Требует строгого соблюдения ЖЁСТКИХ ПРАВИЛ и КОНТРАКТА ВЫХОДА","Ограничен генерацией файлов PRAYER_PACK.json только","Должен использовать формальный язык суда и избегать агрессивных обвинений"],"ar":["يتطلب الالتزام الصارم بالقواعد الصارمة و 契約 الإخراج","محدود بتوليد ملفات PRAYER_PACK.json فقط","يجب استخدام لغة رسمية للمحكمة وتجنب الاتهامات العدوانية"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"066e217b6c9fcb73b9ca6d26fa22701d7960c893c112d036b1b73345f84e5812","qualityScore":38}');
