en","Installationsanleitung für Sima Form Edit Mode","Tutorial für Sima Form Edit Mode","beste Praktiken für die Verwendung von Sima Form Edit Mode","Sima Form Edit Mode für React","Sima Form Edit Mode für Node.js"],"pt":["como usar sima form edit mode","o que é sima form edit mode","sima form edit mode alternativa","sima form edit mode vs competitors","instalar sima form edit mode","guia de configuração sima form edit mode","desenvolvimento de formulários com ia","ferramentas de edição de formulários"],"ru":["как использовать sima форма режим редактирования","что такое sima форма режим редактирования","сима форма режим редактирования альтернатива","сима форма режим редактирования vs конкуренты","установить sima форма режим редактирования","руководство по настройке sima форма режим редактирования","разработка форм с помощью ии","инструменты для редактирования форм"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام سيما نموذج تحرير الوضع","ما هي سيما نموذج تحرير الوضع","سيما نموذج تحرير الوضع بديل","سيما نموذج تحرير الوضع مقابل المنافسين","تثبيت سيما نموذج تحرير الوضع","دليل إعداد سيما نموذج تحرير الوضع","تطوير النماذج باستخدام الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات تحرير النماذج"]}},"owner":"RosenGray","repo":"sima","repoPath":"RosenGray/sima","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.821Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"sima-form-edit-mode","description":"Form edit mode implementation guidelines","bodyPreview":"# Form Edit Mode Guidelines\n\n## Overview\n\nForms should support both create and edit modes using the `FormMode` enum. This guide covers implementing edit functionality for existing forms.\n\n## Component Props\n\n- Add props interface to form component:\n ```typescript\n interface FormNameProps {\n   entity?: SerializedEntity; // e.g., SerializedCar, SerializedProfessionalService\n   formMode: FormMode;\n }\n ```\n- Import `FormMode` from `@/components/Form/types/form.types`\n- Import serialized entity type","body":"# Form Edit Mode Guidelines\n\n## Overview\n\nForms should support both create and edit modes using the `FormMode` enum. This guide covers implementing edit functionality for existing forms.\n\n## Component Props\n\n- Add props interface to form component:\n ```typescript\n interface FormNameProps {\n   entity?: SerializedEntity; // e.g., SerializedCar, SerializedProfessionalService\n   formMode: FormMode;\n }\n ```\n- Import `FormMode` from `@/components/Form/types/form.types`\n- Import serialized entity type from appropriate types file (e.g., `SerializedCar` from `@/lib/vehicles/cars/types/cars.types`)\n- Component signature: `const FormName: FC<FormNameProps> = ({ entity, formMode }) => { ... }`\n\n## Form Mode Detection\n\n- Add mode check at the start of component:\n ```typescript\n const isCreateMode = formMode === FormMode.Create;\n ```\n- Use `isCreateMode` to conditionally render UI elements, change button text, or adjust validation\n\n## Required Imports for Edit Mode\n\n- `FormMode` from `@/components/Form/types/form.types`\n- `SerializedEntity` type from appropriate types file\n- `ExistingImageItem` from `@/lib/files/uploadFiles`\n- Edit action function (e.g., `editCarAd` from `@/lib/vehicles/cars/actions/editCarAd`)\n\n## Existing Images State Management\n\n- Initialize `existingImages` state from entity data:\n ```typescript\n const [existingImages, setExistingImages] = useState<ExistingImageItem[]>(\n   () => {\n     return (\n       entity?.images.map((image) => ({\n         ...image,\n         isExisting: true,\n         toBeDeleted: false,\n       })) || []\n     );\n   }\n );\n ```\n- Track images marked for deletion:\n ```typescript\n const imagesToDelete = useMemo(() => {\n   return existingImages.filter((image) => image.toBeDeleted);\n }, [existingImages]);\n ```\n- Check if all images are being deleted:\n ```typescript\n const allImagesShouldBeDeleted =\n   imagesToDelete.length === existingImages.length;\n ```\n\n## Action Binding for Edit Mode\n\n- Bind edit action with context for edit mode:\n ```typescript\n const updateEntityWithImagesToDelete = editEntityAd.bind(null, {\n   entityPublicId: entity?.publicId as string,\n   imagesToDelete,\n   allImagesShouldBeDeleted,\n });\n ```\n- Conditionally use create or edit action:\n ```typescript\n const [formState, formAction, isPending] = useActionState(\n   isCreateMode ? publishEntityAd : updateEntityWithImagesToDelete,\n   undefined\n );\n ```\n\n## Form Default Values for Edit Mode\n\n- Populate `defaultValue` object from entity data when in edit mode:\n ```typescript\n const [form, fields] = useForm({\n   defaultValue: {\n     // String fields\n     fieldName: entity?.fieldName || \"\",\n     \n     // Number fields - convert to string for form inputs\n     numericField: entity?.numericField?.toString() || \"\",\n     \n     // Price fields - convert to string (PriceFormField will format with commas)\n     price: entity?.price?.toString() || \"\",\n     \n     // Enum fields\n     enumField: entity?.enumField || \"\",\n     \n     // Optional fields with defaults\n     optionalField: entity?.optionalField || \"\",\n     \n     // Checkbox fields\n     acceptTerms: entity?.acceptTerms ? \"on\" : null,\n     \n     // Arrays\n     images: [],\n   },\n   // ... rest of form config\n });\n ```\n- Always provide fallback values (empty strings, null, empty arrays)\n- Convert numbers to strings for form inputs (they''ll be converted back by schema)\n- For checkboxes, use `\"on\"` if entity value is true, `null` if false/undefined\n\n## Image Handling in Edit Mode\n\n- Update `DropFilesInput` to account for existing images:\n ```typescript\n <DropFilesInput\n   // ... other props\n   existingFilesLength={\n     existingImages.filter((image) => !image.toBeDeleted).length\n   }\n />\n ```\n- Update `ImagesPreviewer` to handle existing images:\n ```typescript\n {(existingImages.length > 0 || selectedFiles.length > 0) && (\n   <Box>\n     <ImagesPreviewer\n       existingImages={existingImages}\n       images={selectedFiles}\n       setImages={setSelectedFiles}\n       setExistingImages={setExistingImages}\n       maxImages={MAX_FILES}\n     />\n   </Box>\n )}\n ```\n- Show preview when there are existing images OR new selected files\n\n## Validation Schema Adjustments\n\n- Adjust `minNumberOfImages` based on deletion state:\n ```typescript\n return parseWithZod(updatedFormData, {\n   schema: createEntitySchema({\n     minNumberOfImages: allImagesShouldBeDeleted ? 1 : 0,\n   }),\n });\n ```\n- In edit mode, if all existing images are deleted, require at least 1 new image\n- If some images remain, allow 0 new images (images are optional)\n\n## Submit Button Text\n\n- Conditionally set button text based on mode:\n ```typescript\n <SubmitButton\n   pending={isPending}\n   disabled={acceptTerms.value !== \"on\"}\n   text={isCreateMode ? \"Добавить объявление\" : \"Сохранить изменения\"}\n />\n ```\n\n## Page Component Updates\n\n### Create Page\n\n- Pass `formMode={FormMode.Create}` to form component:\n ```typescript\n <FormName formMode={FormMode.Create} />\n ```\n\n### Edit Page\n\n- Fetch entity data using repository:\n ```typescript\n const entity = await entityRepository.getByPublicId(id);\n if (!entity) return notFound();\n ```\n- Verify ownership:\n ```typescript\n const isOwner = await thisUserIsOwner(entity.user.id);\n if (!isOwner) return notFound();\n ```\n- Pass entity and formMode to form:\n ```typescript\n <FormName entity={entity} formMode={FormMode.Edit} />\n ```\n\n## Edit Action Server Function Structure\n\n- Edit action should accept context as first parameter:\n ```typescript\n export async function editEntityAd(\n   context: {\n     entityPublicId: string;\n     imagesToDelete: ExistingImageItem[];\n     allImagesShouldBeDeleted: boolean;\n   },\n   initialState: unknown,\n   formData: FormData\n ) {\n   // ... implementation\n }\n ```\n- Handle image deletion before processing new uploads\n- Merge remaining existing images with newly uploaded images\n- Use repository pattern to update entity\n\n## Error Handling\n\n- Same error handling as create mode\n- Use `ErrorModal` component\n- Reset form on modal close (same as create mode)\n\n## Loading States\n\n- Same loading states as create mode\n- Show `Loader` when `isPending` is true\n- Disable all fields during submission\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Always check `isCreateMode` before accessing `entity` properties\n- Use optional chaining (`entity?.property`) when accessing entity data\n- Provide sensible defaults for all fields\n- Ensure edit action properly handles partial updates\n- Test both create and edit flows\n- Verify image deletion and upload work correctly together\n- Ensure validation works correctly in both modes\n- Follow the pattern established in `ProfessionalServicePublishForm` and `CarPublishForm`\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Conditional Rendering Based on Mode\n\n```typescript\n{isCreateMode ? (\n  <Text>Создание нового объявления</Text>\n) : (\n  <Text>Редактирование объявления</Text>\n)}\n```\n\n### Safe Entity Property Access\n\n```typescript\nconst defaultValue = entity?.property ?? fallbackValue;\n```\n\n### Number Field Conversion\n\n```typescript\n// In defaultValue\nnumericField: entity?.numericField?.toString() || \"\",\n\n// Schema handles conversion back to number via z.coerce.number()\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:39:01.883Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing dynamic form rendering and editing capabilities with TypeScript and FormMode enum.","zh":"非常适合需要使用TypeScript和FormMode enum实现动态表单渲染和编辑功能的前端代理。","ja":"TypeScriptとFormMode enumを使用して動的なフォームレンダリングと編集機能を実現する必要があるフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"TypeScript와 FormMode enum을 사용하여 동적 폼 렌더링 및 편집 기능을 구현해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan renderizado y edición de formularios dinámicos con TypeScript y enum FormMode.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin d''un rendu et d''une édition de formulaires dynamiques avec TypeScript et enum FormMode.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die dynamisches Rendern und Editieren von Formularen mit TypeScript und FormMode-Enum benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de renderização e edição de formulários dinâmicos com TypeScript e enum FormMode.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы динамические возможности рендеринга и редактирования форм с помощью TypeScript и перечисления FormMode.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى تقديم استمارة ديناميكي وتحرير مع TypeScript وترتيب FormMode."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement edit functionality for existing forms using the FormMode enum and SerializedEntity types, enabling seamless transitions between create and edit modes with imported props interfaces and type checking.","zh":"赋予代理实现现有表单的编辑功能，使用FormMode enum和SerializedEntity类型，实现创建和编辑模式之间的无缝转换，并导入属性接口和类型检查。","ja":"エージェントがFormMode enumとSerializedEntityタイプを使用して既存のフォームの編集機能を実装できるようにし、作成と編集モードの間のシームレスな遷移を可能にし、プロパティインターフェイスとタイプチェックをインポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 FormMode enum과 SerializedEntity 유형을 사용하여 기존 폼의 편집 기능을 구현할 수 있도록 하며, 생성 및 편집 모드 사이의 무결점 전환을 가능하게 하고, 속성 인터페이스 및 유형 검사를 가져옵니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar la funcionalidad de edición para formularios existentes utilizando el enum FormMode y tipos SerializedEntity, lo que permite transiciones sin problemas entre los modos de creación y edición con interfaces de propiedades importadas y verificación de tipos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre la fonctionnalité d''édition pour les formulaires existants à l''aide de l''enum FormMode et des types SerializedEntity, ce qui permet des transitions sans heurts entre les modes de création et d''édition avec des interfaces de propriétés importées et une vérification de types.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Edit-Funktion für bestehende Formulare mit dem FormMode-Enum und SerializedEntity-Typen zu implementieren, wodurch nahtlose Übergänge zwischen Erstellungs- und Editiermodus mit importierten Props-Schnittstellen und Typüberprüfung ermöglicht werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar a funcionalidade de edição para formulários existentes usando o enum FormMode e tipos SerializedEntity, permitindo transições sem problemas entre os modos de criação e edição com interfaces de propriedades importadas e verificação de tipo.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовать функциональность редактирования для существующих форм, используя перечисление FormMode и типы SerializedEntity, что позволяет обеспечить бесшовные переходы между режимами создания и редактирования с помощью импортированных интерфейсов свойств и проверки типов.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تنفيذ وظيفة التحرير للاستمارات الحالية باستخدام ترتيب FormMode وأنواع SerializedEntity ، مما يسمح بالانتقالات السلسة بين وضعين الإنشاء والتحرير باستخدام واجهات الخصائص المستوردة وعمليات التحقق من النوع."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing form edit mode for SerializedEntity instances","Adding FormMode enum support to existing form components","Validating form data with entity-specific props interfaces"],"zh":["为SerializedEntity实例实现表单编辑模式","为现有表单组件添加FormMode enum支持","使用实体特定属性接口验证表单数据"],"ja":["SerializedEntityインスタンスのフォーム編集モードを実装する","既存のフォームコンポーネントにFormMode enumのサポートを追加する","エンティティ固有のプロパティインターフェイスを使用してフォームデータを検証する"],"ko":["SerializedEntity 인스턴스의 폼 편집 모드를 구현하는 것","기존 폼 컴포넌트에 FormMode enum 지원 추가","엔티티별 속성 인터페이스를 사용하여 폼 데이터를 검증하는 것"],"es":["Implementar el modo de edición de formularios para instancias de SerializedEntity","Agregar compatibilidad con el enum FormMode a componentes de formularios existentes","Validar datos de formularios con interfaces de propiedades específicas de la entidad"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre le mode d''édition de formulaires pour les instances de SerializedEntity","Ajouter la prise en charge de l''enum FormMode aux composants de formulaires existants","Valider les données de formulaire avec des interfaces de propriétés spécifiques à l''entité"],"de":["Implementieren des Editiermodus für SerializedEntity-Instanzen","Hinzufügen der Unterstützung für das FormMode-Enum zu bestehenden Formularkomponenten","Validieren von Formulardaten mit entitätsspezifischen Props-Schnittstellen"],"pt":["Implementar modo de edição de formulário para instâncias SerializedEntity","Adicionar suporte ao enum FormMode a componentes de formulário existentes","Validar dados de formulário com interfaces de propriedades específicas da entidade"],"ru":["Реализация режима редактирования формы для экземпляров SerializedEntity","Добавление поддержки перечисления FormMode к существующим компонентам формы","Проверка данных формы с помощью интерфейсов свойств, специфичных для сущности"],"ar":["تنفيذ وضع تحرير الاستمارة لمثيلات SerializedEntity","إضافة دعم لترتيب FormMode إلى مكونات الاستمارة الحالية","التحقق من بيانات الاستمارة باستخدام واجهات الخصائص المحددة للكيان"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires TypeScript and @/components/Form/types/form.types import","Limited to form components with FormNameProps interface"],"zh":["需要TypeScript和@/components/Form/types/form.types导入","仅限于具有FormNameProps接口的表单组件"],"ja":["TypeScriptと@/components/Form/types/form.typesのインポートが必要","FormNamePropsインターフェイスを持つフォームコンポーネントに限定される"],"ko":["TypeScript와 @/components/Form/types/form.types 가져오기가 필요","FormNameProps 인터페이스를 갖는 폼 컴포넌트로 제한"],"es":["Requiere TypeScript y la importación de @/components/Form/types/form.types","Limitado a componentes de formularios con la interfaz FormNameProps"],"fr":["Nécessite TypeScript et l''importation de @/components/Form/types/form.types","Limité aux composants de formulaires avec l''interface FormNameProps"],"de":["Benötigt TypeScript und die Importierung von @/components/Form/types/form.types","Begrenzt auf Formularkomponenten mit der FormNameProps-Schnittstelle"],"pt":["Requer TypeScript e importação de @/components/Form/types/form.types","Limitado a componentes de formulário com interface FormNameProps"],"ru":["Требуется TypeScript и импорт @/components/Form/types/form.types","Ограничен компонентами формы с интерфейсом FormNameProps"],"ar":["يتطلب TypeScript واستيراد @/components/Form/types/form.types","محدود بمكونات الاستمارة التي تتمتع واجهة FormNameProps"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"d1fe0d753f1887b961de15563d7ca5e010ac6bf0840dbb258f1b133e154dcc15","qualityScore":37}');
