l''ingestion de données","Amélioration de l''efficacité dans l''analyse de données","Compatibilité avec des formats de données variés"],"de":["Erweiterte Telemetrie-Analyse","Integration mit Bauplan","WAP-Workflow für die Aufnahme von Daten","Verbesserung der Effizienz bei der Datenanalyse","Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen Datenformaten"],"pt":["Análise de telemetria avançada","Integração com o workflow Bauplan","Suporte à ferramenta Intella","Melhoria da eficiência da análise","Fácil implementação e configuração"],"ru":["Расширенный анализ телеметрии","Интеграция с рабочим процессом Bauplan","Поддержка инструмента Intella","Улучшение эффективности анализа","Легкая реализация и конфигурация"],"ar":["تحليل متقدم للتелеметري","التكامل مع تدفق العمل باوبلان","دعم أداة إنترللا","تحسين كفاءة التحليل","تثبيت وتهيئة سهلة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用wap-ingestion","wap-ingestion是什么","Intella替代品","wap-ingestion安装","wap-ingestion设置指南","AI智能代理","WAP工作流程","遥测分析"],"ja":["wap-ingestionの使用方法","wap-ingestionとは","Intellaの代替","wap-ingestionのインストール","wap-ingestionの設定ガイド","AIエージェント","WAPワークフロー","テレメトリ分析"],"ko":["wap-ingestion 사용 방법","wap-ingestion이란","인텔라 대체","wap-ingestion 설치","wap-ingestion 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트","WAP 워크플로우","텔레메트리 분석"],"es":["herramientas de AI para análisis de telemetría","WAP Ingestion vs otros herramientas de AI","cómo usar WAP Ingestion para análisis de datos","guía de instalación de WAP Ingestion","alternativas a WAP Ingestion","análisis de telemetría con Bauplan","WAP Ingestion para desarrolladores","introducción a WAP Ingestion"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour l''analyse de télémétrie","WAP Ingestion vs autres outils d''IA","comment utiliser WAP Ingestion pour l''analyse de données","guide d''installation de WAP Ingestion","alternatives à WAP Ingestion","analyse de télémétrie avec Bauplan","WAP Ingestion pour les développeurs","introduction à WAP Ingestion"],"de":["KI-Tools für Telemetrie-Analyse","WAP Ingestion vs andere KI-Tools","wie man WAP Ingestion für Datenanalyse verwendet","Installationsanleitung für WAP Ingestion","Alternativen zu WAP Ingestion","Telemetrie-Analyse mit Bauplan","WAP Ingestion für Entwickler","Einführung in WAP Ingestion"],"pt":["como usar WAP Ingestion","o que é WAP Ingestion","ferramentas de IA para análise de telemetria","WAP Ingestion vs outras ferramentas","guia de instalação do WAP Ingestion","configuração do WAP Ingestion","análise de telemetria com Intella","workflow Bauplan para análise de telemetria"],"ru":["как использовать WAP Ingestion","что такое WAP Ingestion","ИИ инструменты для анализа телеметрии","WAP Ingestion vs другие инструменты","руководство по установке WAP Ingestion","конфигурация WAP Ingestion","анализ телеметрии с Intella","рабочий процесс Bauplan для анализа телеметрии"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام لواب إنجيستن","ما هي لواب إنجيستن","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لتحليل التелеметري","لواب إنجيستن مقابل أدوات أخرى","دليل تثبيت لواب إنجيستن","تهيئة لواب إنجيستن","تحليل التелеметري مع إنترللا","تدفق العمل باوبلان لتحليل التелеметري"]}},"owner":"BauplanLabs","repo":"case-study-intella","repoPath":"BauplanLabs/case-study-intella","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-28T01:32:52.476Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"wap-ingestion","description":"Ingest data from S3 into bauplan using the Write-Audit-Publish pattern for safe data loading. Use when loading new data from S3, performing safe data ingestion, or when the user mentions WAP, data ingestion, importing parquet/csv/jsonl files, or needs to safely load data with quality checks.","bodyPreview":"# Write-Audit-Publish (WAP) Pattern\n\nImplement WAP by writing a Python script using the `bauplan` SDK. Do NOT use CLI commands.\n\n**The three steps**: Write (ingest to temp branch) → Audit (quality checks) → Publish (merge to main)\n\n**Branch safety**: All operations happen on a temporary branch, NEVER on `main`. By default, branches are kept open for inspection after success or failure.\n\n**Atomic multi-table operations**: `merge_branch` is atomic. You can create or modify multiple tables on a bra","body":"# Write-Audit-Publish (WAP) Pattern\n\nImplement WAP by writing a Python script using the `bauplan` SDK. Do NOT use CLI commands.\n\n**The three steps**: Write (ingest to temp branch) → Audit (quality checks) → Publish (merge to main)\n\n**Branch safety**: All operations happen on a temporary branch, NEVER on `main`. By default, branches are kept open for inspection after success or failure.\n\n**Atomic multi-table operations**: `merge_branch` is atomic. You can create or modify multiple tables on a branch, and when you merge, either all changes apply to main or none do. This enables safe multi-table ingestion workflows.\n\n## Required User Input\n\nBefore writing the WAP script, you MUST ask the user for the following parameters:\n\n1. **S3 path** (required): The S3 URI pattern for the source data (e.g., `s3://bucket/path/*.parquet`)\n2. **Table name** (required): The name for the target table\n3. **On success behavior** (optional):\n   - `inspect` (default): Keep the branch open for user inspection before merging\n   - `merge`: Automatically merge to main and delete the branch\n4. **On failure behavior** (optional):\n   - `keep` (default): Leave the branch open for inspection/debugging\n   - `delete`: Delete the failed branch\n\n## WAP Script Template\n\nThis is the complete template for WAP:\n```python\n\"\"\"\nWAP (Write-Audit-Publish) Template for bauplan data ingestion.\n\nUsage:\n    python wap_template.py\n\nOr import and call wap_ingest() with your parameters.\n\"\"\"\nimport bauplan\nfrom datetime import datetime\n\n\ndef wap_ingest(\n    table_name: str,\n    s3_path: str,\n    namespace: str = \"bauplan\",\n    on_success: str = \"inspect\",  # \"inspect\" (default) or \"merge\"\n    on_failure: str = \"keep\",  # \"keep\" (default) or \"delete\"\n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Write-Audit-Publish flow for safe data ingestion.\n\n    Args:\n        table_name: Target table name\n        s3_path: S3 URI pattern (e.g., ''s3://bucket/path/*.parquet'')\n        namespace: Target namespace (default: ''bauplan'')\n        on_success: \"inspect\" to keep branch for review, \"merge\" to auto-merge\n        on_failure: \"keep\" to preserve branch for debugging, \"delete\" to cleanup\n\n    Returns:\n        tuple: (branch_name, success)\n    \"\"\"\n    client = bauplan.Client()\n\n    # Generate unique branch name using username\n    info = client.info()\n    username = info.user.username\n    branch_name = f\"{username}.wap_{table_name}_{int(datetime.now().timestamp())}\"\n\n    success = False\n    try:\n        # === WRITE PHASE ===\n        # 1. Create temporary branch from main (must not exist)\n        assert not client.has_branch(branch_name), (\n            f\"Branch ''{branch_name}'' already exists - this should be an ephemeral branch\"\n        )\n        client.create_branch(branch_name, from_ref=\"main\")\n\n        # 2. Verify table doesn''t exist on branch before creating\n        assert not client.has_table(\n            table=table_name, ref=branch_name, namespace=namespace\n        ), (\n            f\"Table ''{namespace}.{table_name}'' already exists on branch - refusing to overwrite\"\n        )\n\n        # 3. Create table (schema inferred from S3 files)\n        client.create_table(\n            table=table_name,\n            search_uri=s3_path,\n            namespace=namespace,\n            branch=branch_name,\n        )\n\n        # 4. Import data into table\n        client.import_data(\n            table=table_name,\n            search_uri=s3_path,\n            namespace=namespace,\n            branch=branch_name,\n        )\n\n        # === AUDIT PHASE ===\n        # 5. Run quality check: verify data was imported\n        fq_table = f\"{namespace}.{table_name}\"\n        result = client.query(\n            query=f\"SELECT COUNT(*) as row_count FROM {fq_table}\", ref=branch_name\n        )\n        row_count = result.column(\"row_count\")[0].as_py()\n        assert row_count > 0, \"No data was imported\"\n        print(f\"Imported {row_count} rows\")\n\n        success = True\n\n        # === PUBLISH PHASE ===\n        if on_success == \"merge\":\n            # 6. Merge to main and cleanup\n            client.merge_branch(source_ref=branch_name, into_branch=\"main\")\n            print(f\"Successfully published {table_name} to main\")\n            client.delete_branch(branch_name)\n            print(f\"Cleaned up branch: {branch_name}\")\n        else:\n            # Keep branch for inspection\n            print(\n                f\"WAP completed successfully. Branch ''{branch_name}'' ready for inspection.\"\n            )\n            print(\n                f\"To merge manually: client.merge_branch(source_ref=''{branch_name}'', into_branch=''main'')\"\n            )\n\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"WAP failed: {e}\")\n        if on_failure == \"delete\":\n            if client.has_branch(branch_name):\n                client.delete_branch(branch_name)\n                print(f\"Cleaned up failed branch: {branch_name}\")\n        else:\n            print(f\"Branch ''{branch_name}'' preserved for inspection/debugging.\")\n        raise\n\n    return branch_name, success\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    # Example: customize these parameters\n    branch, success = wap_ingest(\n        table_name=\"my_table\",\n        s3_path=\"s3://my-bucket/data/*.parquet\",\n        namespace=\"bauplan\",\n        on_success=\"inspect\",\n        on_failure=\"keep\",\n    )\n```\n\nMinimal usage:\n\n```python\nfrom wap_template import wap_ingest\n\nbranch, success = wap_ingest(\n    table_name=\"orders\",\n    s3_path=\"s3://my-bucket/data/*.parquet\",\n    namespace=\"bauplan\",\n    on_success=\"inspect\",  # or \"merge\"\n    on_failure=\"keep\"      # or \"delete\"\n)\n```\n\n## Key SDK Methods\n\n| Method                                         | Description                                           |\n| ---------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| `bauplan.Client()`                             | Initialize the bauplan client                         |\n| `client.info()`                                | Get client info; access username via `.user.username` |\n| `client.create_branch(name, from_ref=\"main\")`  | Create a new branch from specified ref                |\n| `client.has_branch(name)`                      | Check if branch exists                                |\n| `client.delete_branch(name)`                   | Delete a branch                                       |\n| `client.create_table(table, search_uri, ...)`  | Create table with schema inferred from S3             |\n| `client.import_data(table, search_uri, ...)`   | Import data from S3 into table                        |\n| `client.query(query, ref)`                     | Run SQL query, returns PyArrow Table                  |\n| `client.merge_branch(source_ref, into_branch)` | Merge branch into target                              |\n| `client.has_table(table, ref, namespace)`      | Check if table exists on branch                       |\n\n> **SDK Reference**: For detailed method signatures, check https://docs.bauplanlabs.com/reference/bauplan\n\n## Workflow Checklist\n\nCopy and track progress:\n\n\nWAP Progress:\n- [ ] Ask user for: S3 path, table name, on_success, on_failure\n- [ ] Write script using wap_template.py\n- [ ] Run script: python wap_script.py\n- [ ] Verify output shows row count > 0\n- [ ] If on_success=\"inspect\": confirm branch ready for review\n- [ ] If on_success=\"merge\": confirm merge to main succeeded\n\n\n## Example Output\n\n**Successful run (on_success=\"inspect\")**:\n```bash\n$ python wap_script.py\nImported 15234 rows\nWAP completed successfully. Branch ''alice.wap_orders_1704067200'' ready for inspection.\nTo merge manually: client.merge_branch(source_ref=''alice.wap_orders_1704067200'', into_branch=''main'')\n```\n\n**Successful run (on_success=\"merge\")**:\n```bash\n$ python wap_script.py\nImported 15234 rows\nSuccessfully published orders to main\nCleaned up branch: alice.wap_orders_1704067200\n```\n\n**Failed run (on_failure=\"keep\")**:\n```bash\n$ python wap_script.py\nWAP failed: No data was imported\nBranch ''alice.wap_orders_1704067200'' preserved for inspection/debugging.\n```\n\n## WAP on Existing Tables\n\nTo append data to an existing table, skip `create_table` and only call `import_data`:\n\n```python\n# Table already exists on main - just import new data\nclient.import_data(\n    table=table_name,\n    search_uri=s3_path,\n    namespace=namespace,\n    branch=branch_name\n)\n```\n\nThis appends rows to the existing table schema. The audit and publish phases remain the same: the new rows are automatically sandboxed on the branch until merged.\n\n## CLI Merge After Inspection\n\nWhen `on_success=\"inspect\"` (default), the branch is left open for user review. If the user asks to merge after inspecting the data, use the CLI:\n\n```bash\n# 1. Checkout to main first (required before merging)\nbauplan checkout main\n\n# 2. Merge the WAP branch into main\nbauplan branch merge <username>.wap_<table_name>_<timestamp>\n\n# 3. Optionally delete the branch after successful merge\nbauplan branch rm <username>.wap_<table_name>_<timestamp>\n```\n\n> **Note**: You must be on `main` to run `bauplan branch merge`. The branch name is printed by the WAP script upon completion.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-28T01:43:25.537Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Data Ingestion Agents needing Write-Audit-Publish workflow automation using the Bauplan SDK","zh":"适用于需要使用 Bauplan SDK 实现 Write-Audit-Publish 工作流自动化的数据摄取代理","ja":"Bauplan SDK を使用した Write-Audit-Publish ワークフローの自動化が必要なデータインジェストエージェントに最適","ko":"Bauplan SDK를 사용하여 Write-Audit-Publish 워크플로 자동화를 필요로 하는 데이터 수집 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de ingesta de datos que necesitan automatización del flujo de trabajo Write-Audit-Publish utilizando el SDK de Bauplan","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''ingestion de données ayant besoin d''une automatisation du flux de travail Write-Audit-Publish en utilisant le SDK Bauplan","de":"Perfekt für Data Ingestion Agents, die eine Automatisierung des Write-Audit-Publish-Workflows mit dem Bauplan SDK benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Ingestão de Dados que necessitam de automação de fluxo de trabalho Write-Audit-Publish usando o Bauplan SDK","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов инжестии данных, требующих автоматизации рабочего процесса Write-Audit-Publish с использованием Bauplan SDK","ar":"مثالي لعميل استيعاب البيانات الذين يحتاجون إلى автоматизации سير عمل الكتابة-التدقيق-النشر باستخدام Bauplan SDK"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform atomic multi-table operations using the `merge_branch` function, ensuring branch safety by keeping all operations on a temporary branch, and leveraging the WAP pattern for telemetry analysis with quality checks using Intella","zh":"赋予代理执行原子多表操作的能力，使用 `merge_branch` 函数，确保分支安全性，并通过 Intella 进行遥测分析和质量检查，利用 WAP 模式","ja":"エージェントに原子的なマルチテーブル操作を実行する能力を付与し、`merge_branch` 関数を使用してブランチの安全性を確保し、Intella を使用してテレメトリー分析と品質チェックを行い、WAP パターンを活用する","ko":"에이전트가 원자적 多表操作을 수행할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, `merge_branch` 함수를 사용하여 분기 안전성을 보장하고, Intella를 사용하여 원격 측정 분석 및 품질 검사를 수행하며, WAP 패턴을 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar operaciones atómicas de varias tablas utilizando la función `merge_branch`, garantizando la seguridad de la rama al mantener todas las operaciones en una rama temporal y aprovechando el patrón WAP para el análisis de telemetría con controles de calidad utilizando Intella","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des opérations atomiques multi-tables en utilisant la fonction `merge_branch`, en garantissant la sécurité de la branche en maintenant toutes les opérations sur une branche temporaire et en exploitant le modèle WAP pour l''analyse de télémétrie avec des contrôles de qualité utilisant Intella","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, atomare Operationen auf mehreren Tabellen auszuführen, indem die `merge_branch`-Funktion verwendet wird, wodurch die Sicherheit des Branches gewährleistet ist, indem alle Operationen auf einem temporären Branch durchgeführt werden und das WAP-Muster für die Telemetrie-Analyse mit Qualitätskontrollen unter Verwendung von Intella genutzt wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar operações multi-tabela atômicas usando a função `merge_branch`, garantindo a segurança da branch ao manter todas as operações em uma branch temporária e aproveitando o padrão WAP para análise de telemetria com verificações de qualidade usando Intella","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять атомарные многотабличные операции с помощью функции `merge_branch`, обеспечивая безопасность ветки, сохраняя все операции на временной ветке, и использует шаблон WAP для анализа телеметрии с проверками качества с помощью Intella","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من أداء عمليات الجدول المتعددة الذرية باستخدام دالة `merge_branch` ، مما يضمن سلامة الفرع من خلال الاحتفاظ بجميع العمليات على فرع مؤقت ، واستخدام نمط WAP لتحليل التелеметري مع عمليات فحص الجودة باستخدام Intella"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating data ingestion to temporary branches","Auditing data quality using the WAP workflow","Publishing validated data to the main branch"],"zh":["自动将数据摄取到临时分支","使用 WAP 工作流审计数据质量","将验证的数据发布到主分支"],"ja":["一時ブランチへのデータインジェストの自動化","WAP ワークフローを使用したデータ品質の監査","メインブランチへの検証済みデータの公開"],"ko":["임시 분기への 데이터 수집 자동화","WAP 워크플로를 사용한 데이터 품질 감사","메인 분기への 검증된 데이터 배포"],"es":["Automatización de la ingesta de datos en ramas temporales","Auditoría de la calidad de los datos utilizando el flujo de trabajo WAP","Publicación de datos validados en la rama principal"],"fr":["Automatisation de l''ingestion de données dans des branches temporaires","Audit de la qualité des données en utilisant le flux de travail WAP","Publication de données validées sur la branche principale"],"de":["Automatisierung der Daten-ingestion in temporäre Branches","Prüfung der Datenqualität unter Verwendung des WAP-Workflows","Veröffentlichung von validierten Daten im Haupt-Branch"],"pt":["Automatizar a ingestão de dados para branches temporárias","Auditar a qualidade dos dados usando o fluxo de trabalho WAP","Publicar dados validados para a branch principal"],"ru":["Автоматизировать инжестию данных во временные ветки","Проверять качество данных с помощью рабочего процесса WAP","Публиковать проверенные данные в основную ветку"],"ar":["التحكم الآلي في استيعاب البيانات إلى الفروع المؤقتة","فحص جودة البيانات باستخدام سير عمل WAP","نشر البيانات المعتمدة إلى الفرع الرئيسي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Bauplan SDK","Python script implementation only","Branches are kept open for inspection after success or failure"],"zh":["需要 Bauplan SDK","仅限 Python 脚本实现","成功或失败后分支将保持打开状态以便检查"],"ja":["Bauplan SDK が必要","Python スクリプトの実装のみ","成功または失敗後にブランチが検査用に開いたままになる"],"ko":["Bauplan SDK가 필요","Python 스크립트 구현만 가능","성공 또는 실패 후 분기점이 검사용으로 열린 상태로 유지"],"es":["Requiere el SDK de Bauplan","Implementación de script de Python solo","Las ramas se mantienen abiertas para inspección después de éxito o fracaso"],"fr":["Nécessite le SDK Bauplan","Implémentation de script Python uniquement","Les branches sont conservées ouvertes pour inspection après succès ou échec"],"de":["Erfordert das Bauplan SDK","Nur Python-Skriptimplementierung","Branches werden nach Erfolg oder Misserfolg für die Inspektion offen gehalten"],"pt":["Exige o Bauplan SDK","Implementação de script Python apenas","As branches são mantidas abertas para inspeção após sucesso ou falha"],"ru":["Требует использование Bauplan SDK","Реализация только на скрипте Python","Ветки остаются открытыми для проверки после успеха или неудачи"],"ar":["يتطلب Bauplan SDK","تنفيذ سكريبت Python فقط","تظل الفروع مفتوحة للفحص بعد النجاح أو الفشل"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"b1f10b4e85972959837ef89c752cdf600c72d943603ae686264cc4190c2c7a38","qualityScore":37}');
