INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('udecode/plate/kieran-python-reviewer', 'kieran-python-reviewer', 'udecode', 'plate', 'community', 'kieran-python-reviewer udecode plate community ai mcp react shadcn-ui slate typescript wysiwyg The kieran-python-reviewer skill provides AI-powered code reviews for Python developers, ensuring adherence to strict conventions and quality standards. It benefits developers working with FastAPI and other Python frameworks. kieran-python-reviewer是一个基于AI的Python代码审查工具，利用Rich-text editor和MCP技术 kieran-python-reviewerはAIエージェントを使用したPythonコードレビュー工具で、Rich-text editorとMCP技術を活用する kieran-python-reviewer는 AI를 기반으로 하는 파이썬 코드 리뷰 도구로 Rich-text editor와 MCP 기술을 활용합니다 kieran-python-reviewer es un agente de revisión de código Python que utiliza tecnologías de edición de texto enriquecido y MCP para garantizar la calidad del código kieran-python-reviewer est un agent de révision de code Python qui utilise des technologies de texte enrichi et MCP pour garantir la qualité du code kieran-python-reviewer ist ein Agent zur Überprüfung von Python-Code, der reiche Text-Editing-Technologien und MCP verwendet, um die Code-Qualität zu gewährleisten O kieran-python-reviewer é uma ferramenta de revisão de código Python com AI, MCP e shadcn/ui, que ajuda a melhorar a qualidade do código kieran-python-reviewer - это инструмент проверки кода Python с ИИ, MCP и shadcn/ui, который помогает улучшить качество кода kieran-python-reviewer هو أداة مراجعة كود بايثون بالذكاء الاصطناعي، MCP و shadcn/ui، التي تساعد على تحسين جودة الكود how to use kieran-python-reviewer kieran-python-reviewer setup guide kieran-python-reviewer alternative kieran-python-reviewer vs pycodechecker install kieran-python-reviewer kieran-python-reviewer for FastAPI development AI-powered Python code review MCP code analysis shadcn/ui integration Slate and TypeScript support kieran-python-reviewer AI代码审查 Python代码质量 Rich-text editor MCP技术 shadcn/ui Slate TypeScript AI工具 Applies strict Python conventions using AI-driven reviews Supports integration with FastAPI endpoints for automated code checks Utilizes shadcn/ui for a rich-text editing experience Employs MCP for enhanced code analysis and review capabilities Compatible with Slate and TypeScript for seamless development workflows Enables automated code reviews for improved quality and standards compliance kieran-python-reviewer is a rich-text editor skill that utilizes AI, MCP, and shadcn/ui to review Python code, applying strict quality checks and conventions.');
