fication de code","TDD dans IntelliJ","Gradle dans IntelliJ","commit sécurisé","développement de logiciels sécurisés"],"de":["Commit in IntelliJ","Snyk für IntelliJ","Vulnerabilitätsscanner","Code-Überprüfung","TDD in IntelliJ","Gradle in IntelliJ","sicherer Commit","sichere Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["commit","Snyk Vulnerability Scanner","IDEs baseados em IntelliJ","desenvolvimento de software","segurança de código","TDD","pre-commit checks","testes automatizados","desenvolvedores","programação"],"ru":["коммит","Snyk Vulnerability Scanner","ИИ Агенты","IDE на основе IntelliJ","разработка программного обеспечения","безопасность кода","TDD","предварительные проверки коммита","автоматические тесты","разработчики","программирование"],"ar":["Commit","Snyk Vulnerability Scanner","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","IDEs المبنية على منصة IntelliJ","تنمية البرمجيات","أمان الكود","TDD","فحوصات ما قبل Commit","اختبارات آلية","مطورون","برمجة"]}},"owner":"snyk","repo":"snyk-intellij-plugin","repoPath":"snyk/snyk-intellij-plugin","stars":65,"forks":35,"updatedAt":"2026-02-27T19:11:21Z","topics":["ide-plugin","intellij","intellij-plugin","snyk"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"commit","description":"Prepare and commit code changes with full verification, pre-commit checks, and tests. Runs verification skill, fixes issues using TDD, executes all test suites, and creates atomic commits. Use when ready to commit changes, before committing, or when asked to prepare a commit.","bodyPreview":"# Commit Workflow\n\nPrepare, verify, and commit code changes following project standards.\n\n## Workflow Overview\n\n```\nVerify → Fix Issues (TDD) → Pre-commit Checks → Commit → Tests → [Push]\n```\n\n## Quick Start Checklist\n\nCopy and track progress:\n\n```\nCommit Progress:\n- [ ] Step 1: Run verification skill\n- [ ] Step 2: Fix issues using TDD\n- [ ] Step 3: Run pre-commit checks\n- [ ] Step 4: Create atomic commit\n- [ ] Step 5: Run ALL test suites (3 REQUIRED):\n      - [ ] ./gradlew ktlintCheck spotlessA","body":"# Commit Workflow\n\nPrepare, verify, and commit code changes following project standards.\n\n## Workflow Overview\n\n```\nVerify → Fix Issues (TDD) → Pre-commit Checks → Commit → Tests → [Push]\n```\n\n## Quick Start Checklist\n\nCopy and track progress:\n\n```\nCommit Progress:\n- [ ] Step 1: Run verification skill\n- [ ] Step 2: Fix issues using TDD\n- [ ] Step 3: Run pre-commit checks\n- [ ] Step 4: Create atomic commit\n- [ ] Step 5: Run ALL test suites (3 REQUIRED):\n      - [ ] ./gradlew ktlintCheck spotlessApply\n      - [ ] ./gradlew koverXMLReport\n      - [ ] ./gradlew verifyPlugin\n- [ ] Step 6: Push (optional, ask first)\n```\n\n**CRITICAL: Step 5 has THREE mandatory test suites. Skipping any is FORBIDDEN.**\n\n---\n\n## Step 1: Run Verification Skill\n\nExecute the **verification** skill to analyze code changes:\n\n```\nVerification Progress:\n- [ ] Load project rules and standards\n- [ ] Trace code paths for modified files\n- [ ] Check for semantic changes\n- [ ] Identify code smells\n- [ ] Run security scans\n- [ ] Review PR feedback (if PR exists)\n```\n\nRead and follow: `.cursor/skills/verification/SKILL.md`\n\n**Output**: List of issues found, categorized by severity.\n\n---\n\n## Step 2: Fix Issues Using TDD\n\nFor each issue identified by verification:\n\n### TDD Gate (MANDATORY)\n\nBefore ANY fix:\n\n- [ ] Write failing test first\n- [ ] Confirm test fails without fix\n- [ ] Implement minimal fix\n- [ ] Confirm test passes\n\n**Never skip TDD. Use `implementation` skill for complex fixes.**\n\n### Issue Priority\n\n1. **Security vulnerabilities** - Fix immediately (except test data)\n2. **Breaking changes** - Confirm intentional, add tests\n3. **Code smells** - Fix immediately\n4. **PR feedback** - Address blockers first\n\n---\n\n## Step 3: Pre-commit Checks\n\nRun:\n\n```bash\n./gradlew ktlintCheck spotlessApply\n./gradlew koverXMLReport\n./gradlew verifyPlugin\n```\n\n### Security Scans\n\nGet absolute path first:\n\n```bash\npwd\n```\n\nThen run:\n\n1. `snyk_sca_scan` with absolute project path\n2. `snyk_code_scan` with absolute project path\n\n**Fix any security issues** (skip test data false positives).\n\n---\n\n## Step 4: Create Atomic Commit\n\n### Pre-commit Verification\n\n```\n- [ ] Linting clean (./gradlew ktlintCheck spotlessApply)\n- [ ] Security scans clean\n- [ ] No implementation plan files staged\n- [ ] Documentation updated (if needed)\n```\n\n### Commit Format\n\n```\ntype(scope): description [XXX-XXXX]\n\nBody explaining what and why.\n```\n\n**Types**: feat, fix, refactor, test, docs, chore, perf\n\n**Extract issue ID from branch:**\n\n```bash\ngit branch --show-current\n```\n\n### Staged Files Check\n\n```bash\n# Review what will be committed\ngit status\ngit diff --staged\n```\n\n**Never commit**:\n\n- Implementation plan files (`*_implementation_plan/`)\n- Secrets or credentials\n- Generated diagram source (commit PNGs only if needed)\n\n### Execute Commit\n\n```bash\ngit add <files>\ngit commit -m \"$(cat <<''EOF''\ntype(scope): description [XXX-XXXX]\n\nBody explaining what and why.\nEOF\n)\"\n```\n\n**NEVER use --no-verify. NEVER amend commits.**\n\n---\n\n## Step 5: Run All Test Suites (After Commit, Before Push)\n\n**CRITICAL: ALL three test suites MUST be executed after commit but before push. Skipping ANY test suite is FORBIDDEN.**\n\n### Execution Order\n\nRun these commands IN ORDER and wait for each to complete:\n\n```bash\n./gradlew ktlintCheck spotlessApply\n./gradlew koverXMLReport\n./gradlew verifyPlugin\n```\n\n### Test Gate Enforcement\n\n**Before proceeding to Step 6, verify:**\n\n1. Did `./gradlew ktlintCheck spotlessApply` complete with all tests passing?\n2. Did `./gradlew koverXMLReport` complete with all tests passing?\n3. Did `./gradlew verifyPlugin` complete with all tests passing?\n\nIf ANY answer is \"no\" or \"I didn''t run it\", STOP and run the missing tests.\n\n### Test Failure Protocol\n\nIf tests fail:\n\n1. **Do not proceed** to push\n2. Identify root cause\n3. Apply TDD fix (test first, then implementation)\n4. Create new commit with fix\n5. Re-run ALL test suites (not just the one that failed)\n6. Continue only when ALL three test suites pass\n\n---\n\n## Step 6: Push (Optional)\n\n### Mandatory Test Checklist\n\nYou MUST run each test suite and check it off. Do NOT proceed to push until ALL boxes are checked:\n\n```\nTest Suite Checklist (ALL REQUIRED):\n      - [ ] ./gradlew ktlintCheck spotlessApply\n      - [ ] ./gradlew koverXMLReport\n      - [ ] ./gradlew verifyPlugin\n```\n\n**Always ask before pushing.**\n\nIf approved:\n\n```bash\ngit push --set-upstream origin $(git branch --show-current)\n```\n\n### After Push\n\nOffer to:\n\n1. Create draft PR (if none exists)\n2. Update PR description (if PR exists)\n3. Check snyk-pr-review-bot comments\n4. Run `sleep` for 60s\n5. Read and run verification skill\n\n---\n\n## Command Reference\n\n| Task                | Command                                            |\n| ------------------- |----------------------------------------------------|\n| Format & lint       | `./gradlew ktlintCheck spotlessApply`              |\n| Unit tests          | `./gradlew test`                                   \n| Integration tests   | `./gradlew verifyPlugin`                           |\n| SCA scan            | `snyk_sca_scan` with absolute path                 |\n| Code scan           | `snyk_code_scan` with absolute path                |\n| Current branch      | `git branch --show-current`                        |\n| Push                | `git push --set-upstream origin $(git branch ...)` |\n\n---\n\n## Red Flags (STOP)\n\n- [ ] Tests failing\n- [ ] **Any test suite skipped**\n- [ ] Security vulnerabilities unfixed\n- [ ] Implementation plan files staged\n- [ ] Unresolved PR blockers\n- [ ] TDD not followed for fixes\n- [ ] --no-verify being considered\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T13:00:49.549Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing standardized commit workflows with pre-commit checks and test suites.","zh":"非常适合需要标准化提交工作流程的代码审查代理，包括提交前检查和测试套件。","ja":"コードレビュー代理が標準化されたコミットワークフローを必要とする場合に最適です。コミット前のチェックとテストスイートを含みます。","ko":"코드 리뷰 에이전트가 표준화된 커밋 워크플로를 필요로 할 때 완벽합니다. 커밋 전 체크 및 테스트 스위트가 포함됩니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de revisión de código que necesitan flujos de trabajo de confirmación estandarizados con comprobaciones previas a la confirmación y conjuntos de pruebas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de revue de code nécessitant des flux de travail de validation standardisés avec des vérifications préalables à la validation et des suites de tests.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agents, die standardisierte Commit-Workflows mit Pre-Commit-Checks und Test-Suiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que necessitam de fluxos de trabalho de commit padronizados com verificações pré-commit e conjuntos de testes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов проверки кода, требующих стандартизированных рабочих процессов коммитов с проверками до коммита и наборами тестов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل مراجعة الشفرة الذي يحتاج إلى سير عمل الإيداع الموحد مع فحص ما قبل الإيداع وحزمة الاختبارات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to verify and commit code changes following project standards, utilizing pre-commit checks and test suites like ktlintCheck and spotlessA, ensuring atomic commits and streamlined development workflows with IntelliJ platform-based IDEs and Snyk Vulnerability Scanner integration.","zh":"赋予代理验证和提交代码更改的能力，遵循项目标准，利用提交前检查和测试套件，如 ktlintCheck 和 spotlessA，确保原子提交和流畅的开发工作流程，集成 IntelliJ 平台和 Snyk Vulnerability Scanner。","ja":"エージェントがプロジェクト標準に従ってコードの変更を検証およびコミットする能力を提供します。コミット前のチェックとテストスイート（ktlintCheck と spotlessA など）を使用し、原子コミットとスムーズな開発ワークフローを確保します。IntelliJ プラットフォームと Snyk Vulnerability Scanner の統合も含みます。","ko":"에이전트가 프로젝트 표준을 따르며 코드 변경을 검증 및 커밋하는 능력을 제공합니다. 커밋 전 체크 및 테스트 스위트(ktlintCheck 및 spotlessA 등)를 사용하여 원자 커밋 및 개발 워크플로우를 원활하게 합니다.또한 IntelliJ 플랫폼 및 Snyk Vulnerability Scanner 통합을 포함합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a verificar y confirmar cambios de código siguiendo los estándares del proyecto, utilizando comprobaciones previas a la confirmación y suites de pruebas como ktlintCheck y spotlessA, asegurando commits atómicos y flujos de desarrollo optimizados con IDEs basadas en la plataforma IntelliJ y la integración del escáner de vulnerabilidades Snyk.","fr":"Permet aux agents de vérifier et de valider les modifications de code en suivant les normes du projet, en utilisant des vérifications préalables à la validation et des suites de tests comme ktlintCheck et spotlessA, garantissant des commits atomiques et des flux de développement rationalisés avec des IDE basées sur la plateforme IntelliJ et l''intégration du scanneur de vulnérabilités Snyk.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Code-Änderungen zu überprüfen und zu committen, indem sie Projektnormen einhalten, Pre-Commit-Checks und Test-Suiten wie ktlintCheck und spotlessA nutzen, um atomische Commits und optimierte Entwicklungs-Workflows mit IntelliJ-Plattform-basierten IDEs und Snyk-Schwachstellen-Scanner-Integration sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a verificar e confirmar alterações de código seguindo os padrões do projeto, utilizando verificações pré-commit e conjuntos de testes como ktlintCheck e spotlessA, garantindo commits atômicos e fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento otimizados com IDEs baseadas na plataforma IntelliJ e integração do Scanner de Vulnerabilidades Snyk.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проверять и подтверждать изменения кода в соответствии со стандартами проекта, используя проверки до коммита и наборы тестов, такие как ktlintCheck и spotlessA, обеспечивая атомарные коммиты и оптимизированные рабочие процессы разработки с помощью IDE на основе платформы IntelliJ и интеграции сканера уязвимостей Snyk.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على التحقق من تغييرات الشفرة وتأكيدتها اتباعًا لمعايير المشروع، باستخدام فحص ما قبل الإيداع وحزمة الاختبارات مثل ktlintCheck و spotlessA، مما يضمن الإيداعات الذرية وجاريات العمل المتطورة المُستخدمة في بيئات التطوير التي تعتمد على منصة IntelliJ وتكامل فاحص الثغرات الأمنية Snyk."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating commit workflows with verification and pre-commit checks","Generating atomic commits with test suites for ktlintCheck and spotlessA","Debugging code issues using TDD and pre-commit checks"],"zh":["自动化提交工作流程，包括验证和提交前检查","生成原子提交，使用测试套件如 ktlintCheck 和 spotlessA","使用 TDD 和提交前检查调试代码问题"],"ja":["検証とコミット前のチェックを含むコミットワークフローの自動化","ktlintCheck と spotlessA などのテストスイートを使用した原子コミットの生成","TDD とコミット前のチェックを使用したコードの問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["검증 및 커밋 전 체크를 포함한 커밋 워크플로 자동화","ktlintCheck 및 spotlessA 등의 테스트 스위트를 사용한 원자 커밋 생성","TDD 및 커밋 전 체크를 사용한 코드 이슈 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar flujos de trabajo de confirmación con verificación y comprobaciones previas a la confirmación","Generar commits atómicos con suites de pruebas para ktlintCheck y spotlessA","Depurar problemas de código utilizando TDD y comprobaciones previas a la confirmación"],"fr":["Automatiser les flux de travail de validation avec vérification et vérifications préalables à la validation","Générer des commits atomiques avec des suites de tests pour ktlintCheck et spotlessA","Déboguer les problèmes de code en utilisant TDD et les vérifications préalables à la validation"],"de":["Automatisieren von Commit-Workflows mit Überprüfung und Pre-Commit-Checks","Erstellen von atomischen Commits mit Test-Suiten für ktlintCheck und spotlessA","Fehlerbehebung von Code-Problemen unter Verwendung von TDD und Pre-Commit-Checks"],"pt":["Automatizar fluxos de trabalho de commit com verificação e verificações pré-commit","Gerar commits atômicos com conjuntos de testes para ktlintCheck e spotlessA","Depurar problemas de código usando TDD e verificações pré-commit"],"ru":["Автоматизация рабочих процессов коммитов с проверкой и проверками до коммита","Генерация атомарных коммитов с наборами тестов для ktlintCheck и spotlessA","Отладка проблем кода с использованием TDD и проверок до коммита"],"ar":["توسيع سير عمل الإيداع تلقائيًا مع التحقق وفحص ما قبل الإيداع","توليد إيداعات ذرية مع حزمة الاختبارات لktlintCheck و spotlessA","تصحيح مشاكل الشفرة باستخدام TDD وفحص ما قبل الإيداع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires IntelliJ platform-based IDEs","Needs Snyk Vulnerability Scanner integration","Limited to projects with predefined test suites like ktlintCheck and spotlessA"],"zh":["需要基于 IntelliJ 平台的 IDE","需要 Snyk Vulnerability Scanner 集成","仅限于具有预定义测试套件的项目，如 ktlintCheck 和 spotlessA"],"ja":["IntelliJ プラットフォームベースの IDE が必要","Snyk Vulnerability Scanner の統合が必要","ktlintCheck と spotlessA などの事前定義されたテストスイートを持つプロジェクトに限定される"],"ko":["IntelliJ 플랫폼 기반 IDE가 필요","Snyk Vulnerability Scanner 통합이 필요","ktlintCheck 및 spotlessA 등의 사전 정의된 테스트 스위트가 있는 프로젝트로 제한"],"es":["Requiere IDEs basadas en la plataforma IntelliJ","Necesita la integración del escáner de vulnerabilidades Snyk","Limitado a proyectos con conjuntos de pruebas predefinidos como ktlintCheck y spotlessA"],"fr":["Nécessite des IDE basées sur la plateforme IntelliJ","Nécessite l''intégration du scanneur de vulnérabilités Snyk","Limité aux projets avec des suites de tests prédéfinies comme ktlintCheck et spotlessA"],"de":["Benötigt IntelliJ-Plattform-basierte IDEs","Benötigt die Integration des Snyk-Schwachstellen-Scanners","Begrenzt auf Projekte mit vordefinierten Test-Suiten wie ktlintCheck und spotlessA"],"pt":["Requer IDEs baseadas na plataforma IntelliJ","Necessita integração do Scanner de Vulnerabilidades Snyk","Limitado a projetos com conjuntos de testes pré-definidos como ktlintCheck e spotlessA"],"ru":["Требует IDE на основе платформы IntelliJ","Требует интеграции сканера уязвимостей Snyk","Ограничен проектами с предварительно определёнными наборами тестов, такими как ktlintCheck и spotlessA"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئات التطوير التي تعتمد على منصة IntelliJ","يحتاج إلى تكامل فاحص الثغرات الأمنية Snyk","محدود بمشاريع تحتوي على حزم اختبارات محددة مسبقًا مثل ktlintCheck و spotlessA"]},"version":4},"con