INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('futuresearch/everyrow-sdk/deploy-mcp', 'deploy-mcp', 'futuresearch', 'everyrow-sdk', 'community', 'deploy-mcp futuresearch everyrow-sdk community claude claude-code filtering llm-agents pandas-dataframe ranking semantic-analysis The deploy-mcp skill automates the deployment of MCP servers, benefiting AI agent developers. It supports quick deployment to staging and production environments. Deploy-MCP 是一个自动化部署 MCP 服务器的工具，支持从主分支或功能分支部署 Deploy-MCP は、MCP サーバーの自動化デプロイを支援するツールです。メインブランチまたは機能ブランチからのデプロイをサポートしています Deploy-MCP는 MCP 서버의 자동화 배포를 지원하는 도구입니다. 메인 브랜치 또는 기능 브랜치에서 배포를 지원합니다 Deploy-mcp es una herramienta para desplegar servidores MCP para agentes de AI, compatible con Claude y Claude Code Deploy-mcp est un outil pour déployer des serveurs MCP pour les agents d''IA, compatible avec Claude et Claude Code Deploy-mcp ist ein Tool zum Bereitstellen von MCP-Servern für KI-Agents, kompatibel mit Claude und Claude Code O deploy-mcp é uma ferramenta para implantar servidores MCP. Ele fornece comandos para configurar e executar tarefas de staging e produção. Deploy-mcp - это инструмент для развертывания серверов MCP. Он предоставляет команды для настройки и выполнения задач стадии и производственного окружения. deploy-mcp هو أداة لنشر خوادم MCP. يوفر أوامر لتنفيذ مهام لمرحلة الإعداد والانتاج. how to use deploy-mcp deploy-mcp setup guide deploy-mcp alternative deploy-mcp vs Claude deploy-mcp install automated deployment with GitHub workflows pandas-dataframe for AI agents semantic analysis for AI agents what is deploy-mcp deploy-mcp tutorial Deploy-MCP AI 研究团队 自动化部署 MCP 服务器 CLI 命令 pandas-dataframe semantic-analysis AI 工具 AI 平台 Supports automated deployment to staging and production environments using GitHub workflows Utilizes pandas-dataframe for efficient data analysis and filtering Enables quick deployment from main branch or feature branches using specific commands Allows for simultaneous deployment to both staging and production environments Leverages semantic analysis and ranking for improved AI agent performance Integrates with Claude and Claude-code for enhanced AI capabilities deploy-mcp is a skill that automates the deployment of MCP servers using GitHub workflows and supports pandas-dataframe for data analysis.');
