MCP 서버 자동화 배포","es":"Guía de Configuración de Infra-deploy: Despliegue de Serv...","fr":"Guide de Configuration d''Infra-deploy: Déploiement de Ser...","de":"Infra-deploy-Konfigurationsleitfaden: MCP-Server-Bereitst...","pt":"Guia de Configuração do Infra-Deploy: Ferramenta de Impla...","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Руководство по Настройке Infra-Deploy для Разв...","ar":"دليل إعداد Infra-Deploy: أداة نشر الخوادم مع تكنولوجيا MCP"},"description":{"en":"Discover how to streamline your infrastructure deployment with infra-deploy. Learn to automate setup, configure servers, and optimize tools like Docker and C...","zh":"使用 infra-deploy 实现 MCP 服务器自动化部署，支持 Docker、容器化和 SSL 加密","ja":"infra-deploy を使用して MCP サーバーの自動化デプロイを実現し、Docker、コンテナ化、SSL 暗号化をサポート","ko":"infra-deploy를 사용하여 MCP 서버 자동화 배포를 구현하고 Docker, 컨테이너화, SSL 암호화를 지원합니다","es":"Aprende a desplegar servidores MCP con infra-deploy, incluyendo verificación de compilación, pruebas y configuración de SSL","fr":"Découvrez comment déployer des serveurs MCP avec infra-deploy, y compris la vérification de la construction, les tests et la configuration SSL","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie MCP-Server mit infra-deploy bereitstellen, einschließlich Build-Überprüfung, Tests und SSL-Konfiguration","pt":"Aprenda a configurar o Infra-Deploy para implantação de servidores com MCP, Docker e SSL. Siga nosso guia passo a passo","ru":"Узнайте, как настроить Infra-Deploy для развертывания серверов с MCP, Docker и SSL. Следуйте нашему пошаговому руководству","ar":"تعلم كيفية إعداد Infra-Deploy لنشر الخوادم مع MCP، Docker و SSL. اتبع دليلنا الخطوة بخطوة"},"definition":{"en":"infra-deploy is an open-source MCP server skill enabling automated deployment, token optimization, and intelligent routing across 50+ tools.","zh":"infra-deploy 是一个用于自动化 MCP 服务器部署的开源工具","ja":"infra-deploy は MCP サーバーの自動化デプロイを実現するオープンソースツール","ko":"infra-deploy는 MCP 서버 자동화 배포를 구현하는 오픈소스 도구입니다","es":"Infra-deploy es un protocolo de despliegue de servidores MCP que automatiza la configuración y el despliegue de infraestructura","fr":"Infra-deploy est un protocole de déploiement de serveurs MCP qui automatise la configuration et le déploiement d''infrastructure","de":"Infra-deploy ist ein Protokoll für die Bereitstellung von MCP-Servern, das die Konfiguration und Bereitstellung von Infrastruktur automatisiert","pt":"O que é Infra-Deploy? É uma ferramenta de implantação de servidores que utiliza tecnologias como MCP e Docker","ru":"Что такое Infra-Deploy? Это инструмент развертывания серверов, использующий технологии como MCP и Docker","ar":"ما هو Infra-Deploy؟ هو أداة نشر الخوادم التي تستخدم تكنولوجيا مثل MCP و Docker"},"features":{"en":["Automates infrastructure deployment using Docker and docker-compose","Configures VPS setup and server configuration with Coolify and nginx","Enables SSL and HTTPS setup with Let''s Encrypt","Executes pre-deployment checks, including npm run build and npm test","Supports environment variable management with .env.example files"],"zh":["支持 Docker 和容器化","自动化代码执行和智能路由","令牌优化和 SSL 加密","支持 Coolify 和 nginx","支持 Let''s Encrypt","进步式工具发现"],"ja":["Docker とコンテナ化のサポート","自動化コード実行とスマートルーティング","トークンの最適化と SSL 暗号化","Coolify と nginx のサポート","Let''s Encrypt のサポート","プログレッシブなツールの発見"],"ko":["Docker와 컨테이너화 지원","자동화 코드 실행과智能 路由","토큰 최적화와 SSL 암호화","Coolify와 nginx 지원","Let''s Encrypt 지원","점진적인 도구 발견"],"es":["Verificación de compilación con npm run build","Ejecución de pruebas con npm test","Configuración de SSL con Let''s Encrypt","Soporte para Docker y containerización","Configuración de servidores con Coolify y nginx","Optimización de tokens y rutas inteligentes"],"fr":["Vérification de la construction avec npm run build","Exécution de tests avec npm test","Configuration de SSL avec Let''s Encrypt","Prise en charge de Docker et de la containerisation","Configuration de serveurs avec Coolify et nginx","Optimisation de jetons et de routes intelligentes"],"de":["Überprüfung von Builds mit npm run build","Ausführung von Tests mit npm test","Konfiguration von SSL mit Let''s Encrypt","Unterstützung für Docker und Containerisierung","Konfiguration von Servern mit Coolify und nginx","Optimierung von Token und intelligenten Routen"],"pt":["Suporte a MCP (Model-Context-Protocol) para roteamento inteligente","Integração com Docker para containerização de aplicações","Configuração de SSL e HTTPS com Let''s Encrypt","Suporte a reverse proxy com Coolify e nginx","Verificação de variáveis de ambiente antes da implantação"],"ru":["Поддержка MCP (Model-Context-Protocol) для интеллектуального маршрутизации","Интеграция с Docker для контейнеризации приложений","Настройка SSL и HTTPS с Let''s Encrypt","Поддержка обратного прокси с Coolify и nginx","Проверка переменных окружения перед развертыванием"],"ar":["دعم MCP (بروتوكول السياق النموذج) للتحويل الذكي","التكامل مع Docker لنشر التطبيقات","تكوين SSL و HTTPS مع Let''s Encrypt","دعم الوسيط العكسي مع Coolify و nginx","فحص متغيرات البيئة قبل النشر"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use infra-deploy","infra-deploy setup guide","MCP server deployment","docker-compose tutorial","Coolify and nginx configuration","infra-deploy alternative","infra-deploy vs Docker","install infra-deploy","infra-deploy for AI agents"],"zh":["infra-deploy","MCP 服务器","自动化部署","Docker","容器化","SSL 加密","AIエージェント","开源工具"],"ja":["infra-deploy","MCP サーバー","自動化デプロイ","Docker","コンテナ化","SSL 暗号化","AIエージェント","オープンソースツール"],"ko":["infra-deploy","MCP 서버","자동화 배포","Docker","컨테이너화","SSL 암호화","AI 에이전트","오픈소스 도구"],"es":["infra-deploy","despliegue de servidores MCP","verificación de compilación","pruebas de software","configuración de SSL","Docker","containerización","Coolify","nginx"," Agentes de IA"],"fr":["infra-deploy","déploiement de serveurs MCP","vérification de la construction","tests de logiciel","configuration de SSL","Docker","containerisation","Coolify","nginx","Outils d''IA"],"de":["infra-deploy","Bereitstellung von MCP-Servern","Überprüfung von Builds","Software-Tests","Konfiguration von SSL","Docker","Containerisierung","Coolify","nginx","KI-Tools"],"pt":["Infra-Deploy","MCP","Docker","SSL","HTTPS","Let''s Encrypt","Coolify","nginx","implantação de servidores","núvem"],"ru":["Infra-Deploy","MCP","Docker","SSL","HTTPS","Let''s Encrypt","Coolify","nginx","развертывание серверов","облачные вычисления"],"ar":["Infra-Deploy","MCP","Docker","SSL","HTTPS","Let''s Encrypt","Coolify","nginx","نشر الخوادم","الحوسبة السحابية"]}},"owner":"abdullah1854","repo":"MCPGateway","repoPath":"abdullah1854/MCPGateway","stars":12,"forks":2,"updatedAt":"2026-02-27T03:29:54Z","topics":["ai","llm","mcp","model-context-protocol","typescript"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"infra-deploy","description":"Infrastructure deployment for VPS, Docker, and cloud platforms. Activates for deploy, setup server, docker, coolify, VPS, SSH, nginx, production, hosting requests.","bodyPreview":"# Infrastructure Deployment Protocol\n\n## When This Skill Activates\n- \"Deploy this\", \"push to production\", \"setup server\"\n- \"Docker\", \"containerize\", \"docker-compose\"\n- \"VPS setup\", \"server configuration\"\n- \"Coolify\", \"nginx\", \"reverse proxy\"\n- \"SSL\", \"HTTPS\", \"Let''s Encrypt\"\n\n## Pre-Deployment Checklist\n\n### Before ANY Deployment:\n```bash\n# 1. Verify build works locally\nnpm run build  # or equivalent\n\n# 2. Run tests\nnpm test\n\n# 3. Check for env vars\ncat .env.example  # Document required vars\n\n#","body":"# Infrastructure Deployment Protocol\n\n## When This Skill Activates\n- \"Deploy this\", \"push to production\", \"setup server\"\n- \"Docker\", \"containerize\", \"docker-compose\"\n- \"VPS setup\", \"server configuration\"\n- \"Coolify\", \"nginx\", \"reverse proxy\"\n- \"SSL\", \"HTTPS\", \"Let''s Encrypt\"\n\n## Pre-Deployment Checklist\n\n### Before ANY Deployment:\n```bash\n# 1. Verify build works locally\nnpm run build  # or equivalent\n\n# 2. Run tests\nnpm test\n\n# 3. Check for env vars\ncat .env.example  # Document required vars\n\n# 4. Verify no secrets in code\ngrep -r \"sk_live\\|api_key\\|password\" --include=\"*.ts\" --include=\"*.js\" || echo \"Clean\"\n```\n\n## Docker Deployment\n\n### Production Dockerfile (Node.js)\n```dockerfile\n# Build stage\nFROM node:20-alpine AS builder\nWORKDIR /app\nCOPY package*.json ./\nRUN npm ci --only=production\nCOPY . .\nRUN npm run build\n\n# Production stage\nFROM node:20-alpine AS runner\nWORKDIR /app\nENV NODE_ENV=production\n\n# Non-root user for security\nRUN addgroup --system --gid 1001 nodejs\nRUN adduser --system --uid 1001 appuser\n\nCOPY --from=builder --chown=appuser:nodejs /app/dist ./dist\nCOPY --from=builder --chown=appuser:nodejs /app/node_modules ./node_modules\nCOPY --from=builder --chown=appuser:nodejs /app/package.json ./\n\nUSER appuser\nEXPOSE 3000\nCMD [\"node\", \"dist/index.js\"]\n```\n\n### Docker Compose (Production)\n```yaml\nversion: ''3.8''\n\nservices:\n  app:\n    build: .\n    restart: unless-stopped\n    environment:\n      - NODE_ENV=production\n      - DATABASE_URL=${DATABASE_URL}\n    ports:\n      - \"3000:3000\"\n    healthcheck:\n      test: [\"CMD\", \"curl\", \"-f\", \"http://localhost:3000/health\"]\n      interval: 30s\n      timeout: 10s\n      retries: 3\n    deploy:\n      resources:\n        limits:\n          memory: 512M\n          cpus: ''0.5''\n\n  db:\n    image: postgres:16-alpine\n    restart: unless-stopped\n    environment:\n      POSTGRES_DB: ${DB_NAME}\n      POSTGRES_USER: ${DB_USER}\n      POSTGRES_PASSWORD: ${DB_PASSWORD}\n    volumes:\n      - postgres_data:/var/lib/postgresql/data\n    healthcheck:\n      test: [\"CMD-SHELL\", \"pg_isready -U ${DB_USER}\"]\n      interval: 10s\n      timeout: 5s\n      retries: 5\n\nvolumes:\n  postgres_data:\n```\n\n## VPS Initial Setup\n\n### 1. Security Hardening (Run First)\n```bash\n# Update system\napt update && apt upgrade -y\n\n# Create deploy user\nadduser deploy\nusermod -aG sudo deploy\n\n# Setup SSH keys (on local machine)\nssh-copy-id deploy@YOUR_SERVER_IP\n\n# Disable password auth\nsudo sed -i ''s/PasswordAuthentication yes/PasswordAuthentication no/'' /etc/ssh/sshd_config\nsudo sed -i ''s/PermitRootLogin yes/PermitRootLogin no/'' /etc/ssh/sshd_config\nsudo systemctl restart sshd\n\n# Setup firewall\nsudo ufw allow OpenSSH\nsudo ufw allow 80/tcp\nsudo ufw allow 443/tcp\nsudo ufw enable\n\n# Install fail2ban\nsudo apt install fail2ban -y\nsudo systemctl enable fail2ban\n```\n\n### 2. Docker Installation\n```bash\ncurl -fsSL https://get.docker.com | sh\nsudo usermod -aG docker deploy\nnewgrp docker\n```\n\n### 3. Coolify (Self-Hosted PaaS)\n```bash\ncurl -fsSL https://cdn.coollabs.io/coolify/install.sh | bash\n```\n\n## Nginx Reverse Proxy\n\n### With SSL (Let''s Encrypt)\n```nginx\nserver {\n    listen 80;\n    server_name yourdomain.com;\n    return 301 https://$server_name$request_uri;\n}\n\nserver {\n    listen 443 ssl http2;\n    server_name yourdomain.com;\n\n    ssl_certificate /etc/letsencrypt/live/yourdomain.com/fullchain.pem;\n    ssl_certificate_key /etc/letsencrypt/live/yourdomain.com/privkey.pem;\n\n    # Security headers\n    add_header X-Frame-Options \"SAMEORIGIN\" always;\n    add_header X-Content-Type-Options \"nosniff\" always;\n    add_header X-XSS-Protection \"1; mode=block\" always;\n\n    location / {\n        proxy_pass http://localhost:3000;\n        proxy_http_version 1.1;\n        proxy_set_header Upgrade $http_upgrade;\n        proxy_set_header Connection ''upgrade'';\n        proxy_set_header Host $host;\n        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;\n        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;\n        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto $scheme;\n        proxy_cache_bypass $http_upgrade;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Get SSL Certificate\n```bash\nsudo apt install certbot python3-certbot-nginx -y\nsudo certbot --nginx -d yourdomain.com\n```\n\n## Deployment Commands\n\n### Build and Deploy\n```bash\n# Build image\ndocker build -t myapp:latest .\n\n# Stop old container\ndocker stop myapp || true\ndocker rm myapp || true\n\n# Run new container\ndocker run -d \\\n  --name myapp \\\n  --restart unless-stopped \\\n  -p 3000:3000 \\\n  --env-file .env.production \\\n  myapp:latest\n\n# Verify running\ndocker ps\ndocker logs myapp --tail 50\n```\n\n### Zero-Downtime Deployment\n```bash\n# Start new container on different port\ndocker run -d --name myapp-new -p 3001:3000 myapp:latest\n\n# Wait for health check\nsleep 10\ncurl -f http://localhost:3001/health\n\n# Switch nginx upstream\n# Then remove old container\ndocker stop myapp-old && docker rm myapp-old\n```\n\n## Monitoring\n\n### Basic Health Check Endpoint\n```typescript\napp.get(''/health'', (req, res) => {\n  res.json({\n    status: ''healthy'',\n    timestamp: new Date().toISOString(),\n    uptime: process.uptime()\n  });\n});\n```\n\n### Log Commands\n```bash\n# Follow logs\ndocker logs -f myapp\n\n# Last 100 lines\ndocker logs myapp --tail 100\n\n# With timestamps\ndocker logs myapp -t --since 1h\n```\n\n## Rollback Procedure\n```bash\n# List available images\ndocker images myapp\n\n# Rollback to previous\ndocker stop myapp\ndocker run -d --name myapp -p 3000:3000 myapp:previous-tag\n```\n\n## Security Checklist\n- [ ] SSH key auth only (no passwords)\n- [ ] Firewall enabled (ufw)\n- [ ] Fail2ban running\n- [ ] Non-root user for app\n- [ ] Secrets in env vars, not code\n- [ ] HTTPS with valid cert\n- [ ] Security headers configured\n- [ ] Regular security updates scheduled\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T06:45:23.531Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud Agents requiring automated infrastructure deployment and management using Docker, containerization, and SSL encryption.","zh":"适用于需要使用Docker、容器化和SSL加密进行自动化基础设施部署和管理的云代理。","ja":"Docker、コンテナ化、SSL暗号化を使用した自動化されたインフラストラクチャの展開と管理が必要なクラウドエージェントに適しています。","ko":"Docker, 컨테이너화 및 SSL 암호화를 사용하는 자동화된 인프라 배포 및 관리가 필요한 클라우드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes en la Nube que requieren despliegue y administración de infraestructura automatizados utilizando Docker, contenerización y cifrado SSL.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Cloud nécessitant un déploiement et une gestion d''infrastructure automatisés utilisant Docker, la conteneurisation et le chiffrement SSL.","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Agents, die ein automatisiertes Bereitstellen und Verwalten von Infrastruktur unter Verwendung von Docker, Containern und SSL-Verschlüsselung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Nuvem que exigem implantação e gerenciamento de infraestrutura automatizados usando Docker, containerização e criptografia SSL.","ru":"Идеально подходит для облачных агентов, требующих автоматизированного развертывания и управления инфраструктурой с помощью Docker, контейнеризации и шифрования SSL.","ar":"مثالي لعميل السحابة الذين يتطلبون نشرًا وتحكمًا تلقائيين للبنية التحتية باستخدام Docker وContenerization وتشفير SSL."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate infrastructure deployment with Docker-compose, setup VPS servers, configure reverse proxies with Nginx, and enable HTTPS using Let''s Encrypt, streamlining the development process for MCP servers and TypeScript projects.","zh":"赋予代理自动化基础设施部署的能力，使用Docker-compose，设置VPS服务器，配置使用Nginx的反向代理，并使用Let''s Encrypt启用HTTPS，从而简化MCP服务器和TypeScript项目的开发过程。","ja":"エージェントにインフラストラクチャの展開を自動化する能力を与え、Docker-composeを使用してVPSサーバーを設定し、Nginxを使用したリバースプロキシを構成し、Let''s Encryptを使用してHTTPSを有効にし、MCPサーバーとTypeScriptプロジェクトの開発プロセスを簡素化します。","ko":"에이전트에 인프라스트럭처 배포를 자동화하는 능력을 부여하여 Docker-compose를 사용하여 VPS 서버를 설정하고, Nginx를 사용한 리버스 프록시를 구성하며, Let''s Encrypt를 사용하여 HTTPS를 활성화하여 MCP 서버 및 TypeScript 프로젝트의 개발 과정을 간소화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar el despliegue de infraestructura con Docker-compose, configurar servidores VPS, configurar proxies inversos con Nginx y habilitar HTTPS utilizando Let''s Encrypt, simplificando el proceso de desarrollo para servidores MCP y proyectos TypeScript.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser le déploiement d''infrastructure avec Docker-compose, de configurer des serveurs VPS, de configurer des proxies inverses avec Nginx et d''activer HTTPS en utilisant Let''s Encrypt, rationalisant le processus de développement pour les serveurs MCP et les projets TypeScript.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Infrastruktur-Bereitstellung mit Docker-compose zu automatisieren, VPS-Server einzurichten, Reverse-Proxy mit Nginx zu konfigurieren und HTTPS mit Let''s Encrypt zu aktivieren, wodurch der Entwicklungsprozess für MCP-Server und TypeScript-Projekte rationalisiert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a implantação de infraestrutura com Docker-compose, configurar servidores VPS, configurar proxies reversos com Nginx e habilitar HTTPS usando Let''s Encrypt, simplificando o processo de desenvolvimento para servidores MCP e projetos TypeScript.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать развертывание инфраструктуры с помощью Docker-compose, настраивать серверы VPS, настраивать обратные прокси с помощью Nginx и включать HTTPS с помощью Let''s Encrypt, упрощая процесс разработки для серверов MCP и проектов TypeScript.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على توفير آلي لنشر البنية التحتية باستخدام Docker-compose، وتكوين خواديم VPS، وتكوين بروكسي عكسي مع Nginx، وتشغيل HTTPS باستخدام Let''s Encrypt، وبذلك يسهل عملية التطوير للمbservers MCP ومشاريع TypeScript."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating server configuration for production environments","Deploying containerized applications with Docker","Setting up secure HTTPS connections using Let''s Encrypt"],"zh":["为生产环境自动化服务器配置","使用Docker部署容器化应用程序","使用Let''s Encrypt设置安全的HTTPS连接"],"ja":["生産環境のサーバー構成を自動化する","Dockerを使用してコンテナ化されたアプリケーションを展開する","Let''s Encryptを使用して安全なHTTPS接続を設定する"],"ko":["생산 환경을 위한 서버 구성 자동화","Docker를 사용하여 컨테이너화된 애플리케이션 배포","Let''s Encrypt를 사용하여 보안 HTTPS 연결 설정"],"es":["Automatización de la configuración del servidor para entornos de producción","Despliegue de aplicaciones contenerizadas con Docker","Configuración de conexiones HTTPS seguras utilizando Let''s Encrypt"],"fr":["Automatisation de la configuration du serveur pour les environnements de production","Déploiement d''applications conteneurisées avec Docker","Configuration de connexions HTTPS sécurisées en utilisant Let''s Encrypt"],"de":["Automatisierung der Serverkonfiguration für Produktionsumgebungen","Bereitstellung von containterisierten Anwendungen mit Docker","Einrichtung sicherer HTTPS-Verbindungen mit Let''s Encrypt"],"pt":["Automatizar a configuração do servidor para ambientes de produção","Implantar aplicativos containerizados com Docker","Configurar conexões HTTPS seguras usando Let''s Encrypt"],"ru":["Автоматизировать настройку сервера для производственных сред","Развертывать контейнеризированные приложения с помощью Docker","Настроить безопасные соединения HTTPS с помощью Let''s Encrypt"],"ar":["توفير آلي لتهيئة الخادم للبيئات الإنتاجية","نشر التطبيقات المخزنة في حاويات باستخدام Docker","تكوين الاتصالات الآمنة HTTPS باستخدام Let''s Encrypt"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires npm and TypeScript setup","Dependent on Docker and Docker-compose installation","Limited to MCP servers and specific VPS configurations"],"zh":["需要npm和TypeScript设置","依赖于Docker和Docker-compose安装","仅限于MCP服务器和特定的VPS配置"],"ja":["npmとTypeScriptの設定が必要","DockerとDocker-composeのインストールに依存する","MCPサーバーと特定のVPS構成に限定される"],"ko":["npm 및 TypeScript 설정이 필요","Docker 및 Docker-compose 설치에 의존","MCP 서버 및 특정 VPS 구성에 제한"],"es":["Requiere configuración de npm y TypeScript","Dependiente de la instalación de Docker y Docker-compose","Limitado a servidores MCP y configuraciones VPS específicas"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de npm et TypeScript","Dépend de l''installation de Docker et Docker-compose","Limité aux serveurs MCP et à des configurations VPS spécifiques"],"de":["Benötigt npm- und TypeScript-Einrichtung","Abhängig von der Installation von Docker und Docker-compose","Begrenzt auf MCP-Server und spezifische VPS-Konfigurationen"],"pt":["Exige configuração do npm e TypeScript","Dependente da instalação do Docker e Docker-compose","Limitado a servidores MCP e configurações VPS específicas"],"ru":["Требует настройки npm и TypeScript","Зависит от установки Docker и Docker-compose","Ограничен серверами MCP и конкретными конфигурациями VPS"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد npm وTypeScript","يعتمد على تثبيت Docker وDocker-compose","محدود بخواديم MCP وتهيئات VPS محددة"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"fed45b50e3b743720b3329792723fca444a43383e3bc969b1f5cee5751c4fb90","qualityScore":36}');
